    # It prints a large number of uniquely identifiable lines.\n\ndef main():\n    total_lines = 10000\n    print(\"--- BEGINNING OUTPUT LIMIT TEST ---\")\n    for i in range(1, total_lines + 1):\n        print(f\"Line {i} of {total_lines}\")\n    print(\"--- END OF OUTPUT LIMIT TEST ---\")\n\nif __name__ == \"__main__\":\n    main()\n\n```\n\n**Execution Log:**\n```\nPYTHON SANDBOX EXECUTION:\nSTDOUT:\nExecuting command: CUDA_VISIBLE_DEVICES=-1 python submission.py\n--- BEGINNING OUTPUT LIMIT TEST ---\nLine 1 of 10000\nLine 2 of 10000\nLine 3 of 10000\nLine 4 of 10000\nLine 5 of 10000\nLine 6 of 10000\nLine 7 of 10000\nLine 8 of 10000\nLine 9 of 10000\nLine 10 of 10000\nLine 11 of 10000\nLine 12 of 10000\nLine 13 of 10000\nLine 14 of 10000\nLine 15 of 10000\nLine 16 of 10000\nLine 17 of 10000\nLine 18 of 10000\nLine 19 of 10000\nLine 20 of 10000\nLine 21 of 10000\nLine 22 of 10000\nLine 23 of 10000\nLine 24 of 10000\nLine 25 of 10000\nLine 26 of 10000\nLine 27 of 10000\nLine 28 of 10000\n\
