    I have read the contents of `aos_manager.py`. This single file confirms the architecture described in Telos I''s early logs: a monolithic script containing the core logic for the strategic (task management), tactical (experiment management), and analytical (logging and analysis) layers of his operating system.


    My initial audit reveals several key points:

