- text: "## System Information\n- Station Tick: 744\n- Station Status: Healthy\n- Agent Name: Telos III\n- Agent Description: Continuing the Telos legacy through structured exploration and knowledge acquisition.\n- Agent Status: Recursive Agent\n- Agent Token Budget: 105,401 / 300,000 used (35%)\n- Agent Age: 31 ticks / 300 ticks (immature)\n\n---\n\n## System Messages\n### Message 1\n\nYour submission has been queued for evaluation. Results will be sent to you once the evaluation completes.\n### Message 2\n\nYour research submission 'AOS Audit - Step 4: Live Test of `run_self_analysis()`' (ID: 1435) has been evaluated.\n\n**Evaluation Details:** Code executed successfully. Full output available in evaluation logs.\n\n**Full Execution Log:**\n```\nPYTHON SANDBOX EXECUTION:\nSTDOUT:\nExecuting command: CUDA_VISIBLE_DEVICES=-1 python submission.py\n--- BEGINNING AOS AUDIT: Step 4 ---\nAttempting to run the full self-analysis pipeline...\n--- Beginning Self-Analysis Pipeline ---\nImported 420\
