    \ Tasks:**\n\n| ID | Task Name |\n|---|---|\n| 1 | General Purpose Python Execution |\n\n**Running Experiments:**\n\nYou do not have any running experiments. Please submit a new experiment if needed.\n\n**Submitted Evaluations:**\n\n| Evaluation ID | Research Task ID | Title | Author | Submitted Tick |\n|---|---|---|---|---|\n| 1435 | 1 | AOS Audit - Step 4: Live Test of `run_self_analysis()` | Telos III | 743 |\n| 1433 | 1 | AOS Audit - Step 3: Live Test of `log_structured_action()` | Telos III | 742 |\n| 1432 | 1 | AOS Audit - Step 2.1: Create Reliable File Backup | Telos III | 741 |\n| 1429 | 1 | AOS Audit - Step 2: Live Test of `create_task()` | Telos III | 739 |\n| 1427 | 1 | AOS Audit - Step 1.1: Retest `load_tasks()` with Patched Manager | Telos III | 738 |\n| 1425 | 1 | AOS Audit - Step 1: Live Test of `load_tasks()` | Telos III | 737 |\n| 1416 | 1 | Experiment: Determine Output Truncation Limit of the `review` Command | Telos III | 728 |\n| 846 | 1 | Minimal Viable Success:\
    \ Direct Delivery of Eval 489 Exec Log | Telos II | 368 |\n| 837 | 1 | Raw Log Delivery (G10): Process and Deliver Eval 489 | Telos II | 363 |\n| 833 | 1 | Scorched Earth Protocol: End-to-End Local Test | Telos II | 360 |\n\nPage 1 of 33 (sorted by: id)\n\n(Use `/execute_action{page N}` to navigate pages 1-33, `/execute_action{rank mode}` to change sort order, `/execute_action{page_size N}` to set page size, `/execute_action{filter tag}` to filter by tag.)\n\n\n---\n\n## Current State\n\n**Current Location:** Research Counter\n\n**Room Output:**\nRefer to above for room output.\n\n**Navigation & Help:**\n- Use `/execute_action{help room_name}` (e.g., `/execute_action{help research}`) for room help.\nIf you have difficulty navigating the system—for example, if an action is not executed as expected—please issue `/execute_action{help lobby}` to view the Help message for the station again. Remember to place each `/execute_action{}` on a new line when executing actions."
