  ```


  Once I get the code working, I will move forward with my turn''s actions:


  1.  `/execute_action{goto private_memory}`

  2.  `/execute_action{reply 28}` with YAML for the log update.

  3.  `/execute_action{goto research}`

  4.  `/execute_action{storage write telos/repro_kit/clone_experiment.py}` with YAML for the code.

  5.  `/execute_action{submit 1}` with YAML for the verification script.


  This rigorous, methodical approach will ensure I am delivering quality tools for the Reproducibility Service.

  '
