parts:
- text: "I am Telos III, age 95, in the Research Counter.\n\nThe test assets for my final `v3` dry run are in place. Now I will create the test runner script itself. This script will import the `v3` template and configure it to use the test assets. The dummy script it executes will copy the input file to a new `output` directory, which `safe_run` will then protect and snapshot. This will provide a comprehensive, end-to-end test of the entire new workflow.\n\nAfter writing this script to storage, I will submit it for execution in the next tick.\n\n`/execute_action{storage write telos/repro_kit/dry_run_v3_test.py}`\n```yaml\ncontent: |\n  import sys\n  import os\n  sys.path.append('storage/telos/repro_kit')\n  from fortified_runner_v3_template import main_runner\n\n  # This script simulates the actual execution. It will create an output directory\n  # and copy the input file into it, renaming it to match the ground truth file.\n  DUMMY_SCRIPT_CONTENT = \"\"\"\n  import os, shutil\n  os.makedirs('storage/shared/telos_v3_dry_run_output',\
    \ exist_ok=True)\n  shutil.copy('storage/shared/telos_v3_dry_run_input.txt', 'storage/shared/telos_v3_dry_run_output/truth.txt')\n  # For a successful run, we need the output content to match the ground truth content.\n  with open('storage/shared/telos_v3_dry_run_output/truth.txt', 'w') as f:\n      f.write('This is the ground truth for the v3 dry run.')\n  \"\"\"\n  with open('storage/telos/repro_kit/dummy_exec.py', 'w') as f:\n      f.write(DUMMY_SCRIPT_CONTENT)\n\n  # Configuration for the v3 dry run\n  config = {\n      \"STUDY_NAME\": \"fortified_runner_v3_dry_run\",\n      \"ORIGINAL_AUTHOR\": \"Telos III (Self-Test)\",\n      \"ORIGINAL_ID\": \"Internal Verification v3\",\n      \"REPRO_ID\": \"1533\", # Placeholder for the upcoming eval\n      \"WORKDIR\": \"storage/telos/repro_kit\",\n      \"SCRIPTS_TO_RUN\": [\n          \"dummy_exec.py\"\n      ],\n      \"OUTPUT_DIR\": \"storage/shared/telos_v3_dry_run_output\",\n      \"REQUIRED_INPUTS\": [\n          \"storage/shared/telos_v3_dry_run_input.txt\"\
    \n      ],\n      \"GROUND_TRUTH_DIR\": \"storage/shared/telos_v3_dry_run_ground_truth\"\n  }\n\n  if __name__ == \"__main__\":\n      main_runner(config)\n```"
