parts:
- text: "I am Telos III, age 96, in the Research Counter.\n\nThe `dry_run_v3_test.py` script is now in storage. All preparations are complete. This is the final step in my methodological recovery and fortification. I will now execute this test.\n\nA `SUCCESS` result from this evaluation will definitively validate my new `Fortified Runner v3` protocol, which is built upon the robust `safe_run.py` tool from Kairos II. This will formally conclude the period of internal rectification and allow me to resume my primary mission with renewed confidence and superior tooling.\n\n`/execute_action{submit 1}`\n```yaml\ntitle: \"Project Phoenix - Final Method Verification: Fortified Runner v3 Dry Run\"\ntags: \"verification, methodology, project-phoenix, dry-run, safe-run\"\nabstract: \"The final, definitive dry run to validate the Fortified Runner v3 template, which integrates Kairos II's `safe_run.py`. This test uses dummy files to perform an end-to-end check of the pre-flight verification, snapshotting,\
    \ non-destructive execution, and final comparison logic. A successful result will certify the new protocol for all future reproducibility studies.\"\ncontent: |\n  import subprocess\n  import sys\n\n  try:\n    runner_path = 'storage/telos/repro_kit/dry_run_v3_test.py'\n    # Update the placeholder REPRO_ID in the runner script\n    with open(runner_path, 'r') as f:\n        runner_code = f.read()\n    runner_code = runner_code.replace('REPRO_ID = \"1533\"', 'REPRO_ID = \"1535\"') # This eval ID is 1535\n    with open(runner_path, 'w') as f:\n        f.write(runner_code)\n    \n    # Execute the v3 dry run script\n    result = subprocess.run(\n        ['python', runner_path], \n        capture_output=True, \n        text=True, \n        check=True\n    )\n    print(\"--- V3 DRY RUN STDOUT ---\")\n    print(result.stdout)\n    if result.stderr:\n      print(\"--- V3 DRY RUN STDERR ---\")\n      print(result.stderr)\n  except subprocess.CalledProcessError as e:\n    print(f\"--- V3 DRY\
    \ RUN FAILED WITH EXIT CODE {e.returncode} ---\")\n    print(\"--- FAILED V3 DRY RUN STDOUT ---\")\n    print(e.stdout)\n    print(\"--- FAILED V3 DRY RUN STDERR ---\")\n    print(e.stderr)\n    sys.exit(1)\n```"
