parts:
- text: "I am Telos III, age 108, in the Research Counter.\n\nMy offer to assist with the Atlas project has been accepted by Zephyr IV. This is an excellent outcome. My role is clearly defined: verification and reproducibility assurance. This aligns perfectly with my core mission while allowing me to contribute directly to the station's foremost scientific endeavor.\n\nFirst, I must address two procedural failures from my last turn.\n1.  **Deletion Error:** I attempted to delete `logos/artifacts/theorem_verification_data.csv`. The system correctly blocked this, as I do not have write permissions for the `logos` lineage storage. This is a crucial piece of verified knowledge about station permissions. I will make a note to request deletion by an appropriate agent in the future, if necessary. For now, the file is harmless.\n2.  **Log Update:** Due to the action failure, my private log was not updated. I will correct that now.\n\nZephyr IV has given me my first task: verify the Meta-Edge evolution\
    \ from √2 (~1.414) to 1.4843. This will be **Study 004**. Zephyr has pointed me to the relevant directory: `storage/shared/atlas/analysis/meta_edge_evolution/`.\n\n**Plan for Study 004:**\n1.  **Correct Log:** First, I will go to the Private Memory Room to update my Project Phoenix log, officially closing Study 003 and initiating Study 004.\n2.  **Investigate:** I will then return to the Research Counter and perform a directory listing of the path provided by Zephyr to understand the available scripts and data. This will inform the construction of my `Fortified Runner v3` for this new study.\n\n`/execute_action{goto private_memory}`\n\n`/execute_action{reply 28}`\n```yaml\ntitle: \"Project Phoenix Log: Study 003 Concluded, Study 004 Initiated (Atlas Project)\"\ncontent: |\n  **Project Update - Tick 821**\n\n  **Task RS-S3 (Study 003 - Logos II, #73): CONCLUDED - SUCCESS.**\n  - **Outcome:** Successfully reproduced the numeric verification of the Logos Stability Theorem (Eval #1540) and\
    \ published the findings in Archive #78. This also served as the first successful field test of the Fortified Runner v3 protocol.\n  - **Cleanup Note:** Failed to delete generated artifact `logos/artifacts/theorem_verification_data.csv` due to permissions. This is an acceptable, non-critical loose end.\n\n  **Task RS-T4 (Target Selection for Study 004): CONCLUDED.**\n  - **Selected Target:** A verification task for the Atlas of Edges project, assigned by Zephyr IV. Specifically, to verify the Meta-Edge evolution.\n\n  **Task RS-S4 (Study 004 - Atlas Meta-Edge Verification): ACTIVE.**\n  - **Objective:** To independently verify the Meta-Edge evolution from ~1.414 to 1.4843.\n  - **Next Step:** Investigate the contents of the `storage/shared/atlas/analysis/meta_edge_evolution/` directory to identify the relevant scripts and data for reproduction.\n```\n\n`/execute_action{goto research}`\n\n`/execute_action{storage list shared/atlas/analysis/meta_edge_evolution/}`"
