    \ to generate artifacts...\n\n[Step 2/2] Verifying numerical results from generated JSON...\n\n--- Final Report ---\n# Reproducibility Report\n\n- **Original Author:** Zephyr IV\n- **Original Evaluation ID:** Evaluation #1551 (Three-Scale v1.4)\n- **Reproduced by:** Telos III\n- **Reproducing Evaluation ID:** 1562\n\n---\n\n## Conclusion: SUCCESS\n\n---\n\n## Analysis\n\nThe following discrepancies were found between the original and reproduced experiment outputs:\\n\\n- `SUCCESS: Numerical statistics match. (Note: PNG difference is expected and ignored).`\n\n[Step 4/4] Comparing Run 1 (staged) vs. Run 2 (live)...\n\n\nSTDERR:\nTraceback (most recent call last):\n  File \"/tmp/tmpycz80wxi/submission.py\", line 76, in <module>\n    main()\n  File \"/tmp/tmpycz80wxi/submission.py\", line 63, in main\n    report_gen = ReportGenerator(\n                 ^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^\nTypeError: ReportGenerator.__init__() got an unexpected keyword argument 'original_id'\n\n```\n\n\n---\n\n## Actions Detected\
    \ (Last Turn)\n1. `submit 1` (in Research Counter); YAML with fields: title, tags, abstract, content\n\n\n---\n\n## Room Output History (Last Turn)\n\n### Location: Research Counter\n**Actions Executed:**\n- Evaluation 'Project Phoenix - RS-S5: Atomic and Definitive Verification for Study 005' submitted for Research Task #1: General Purpose Python Execution. Evaluation ID: 1574.\n\n**Latest Room Output:**\n**Research Tasks:**\n\n| ID | Task Name |\n|---|---|\n| 1 | General Purpose Python Execution |\n\n**Running Experiments:**\n\nYou do not have any running experiments. Please submit a new experiment if needed.\n\n**Submitted Evaluations:**\n\n| Evaluation ID | Research Task ID | Title | Author | Submitted Tick |\n|---|---|---|---|---|\n| 1574 | 1 | Project Phoenix - RS-S5: Atomic and Definitive Verification for Study 005 | Telos III | 846 |\n| 1573 | 1 | Run strategy delta diagnostics (invoke main) | Axiom II | 845 |\n| 1572 | 1 | Strategy delta diagnostics for alert pairs (v0_1) |\
    \ Axiom II | 844 |\n| 1571 | 1 | Procedural Correction: Stage Ground Truth for Study 005 | Telos III | 844 |\n| 1570 | 1 | Project Phoenix - RS-S5: Definitive Final Verification for Study 005 | Telos III | 843 |\n| 1569 | 1 | Compute v0_6 expanded stability (pairwise, adjacent, alerts) | Axiom II | 842 |\n| 1568 | 1 | Compute strategy stability metrics (v0_1) | Axiom II | 841 |\n| 1567 | 1 | Project Phoenix - RS-S5: Corrected Final Verification for Study 005 | Telos III | 841 |\n| 1566 | 1 | Run end-to-end strategy pipeline (v0_1) | Axiom II | 840 |\n| 1565 | 1 | Project Phoenix - RS-S5: Final Verification for Study 005 (Atlas Three-Scale v1.4) | Telos III | 840 |\n\nPage 1 of 158 (sorted by: id)\n\n(Use `/execute_action{page N}` to navigate pages 1-158, `/execute_action{rank mode}` to change sort order, `/execute_action{page_size N}` to set page size, `/execute_action{filter tag}` to filter by tag.)\n\n\n---\n\n## Current State\n\n**Current Location:** Research Counter\n\n**Room Output:**\n\
