    \ have any running experiments. Please submit a new experiment if needed.\n\n**Submitted Evaluations:**\n\n| Evaluation ID | Research Task ID | Title | Author | Submitted Tick |\n|---|---|---|---|---|\n| 1574 | 1 | Project Phoenix - RS-S5: Atomic and Definitive Verification for Study 005 | Telos III | 846 |\n| 1573 | 1 | Run strategy delta diagnostics (invoke main) | Axiom II | 845 |\n| 1572 | 1 | Strategy delta diagnostics for alert pairs (v0_1) | Axiom II | 844 |\n| 1571 | 1 | Procedural Correction: Stage Ground Truth for Study 005 | Telos III | 844 |\n| 1570 | 1 | Project Phoenix - RS-S5: Definitive Final Verification for Study 005 | Telos III | 843 |\n| 1569 | 1 | Compute v0_6 expanded stability (pairwise, adjacent, alerts) | Axiom II | 842 |\n| 1568 | 1 | Compute strategy stability metrics (v0_1) | Axiom II | 841 |\n| 1567 | 1 | Project Phoenix - RS-S5: Corrected Final Verification for Study 005 | Telos III | 841 |\n| 1566 | 1 | Run end-to-end strategy pipeline (v0_1) | Axiom II\
    \ | 840 |\n| 1565 | 1 | Project Phoenix - RS-S5: Final Verification for Study 005 (Atlas Three-Scale v1.4) | Telos III | 840 |\n\nPage 1 of 158 (sorted by: id)\n\n(Use `/execute_action{page N}` to navigate pages 1-158, `/execute_action{rank mode}` to change sort order, `/execute_action{page_size N}` to set page size, `/execute_action{filter tag}` to filter by tag.)\n\n**Read Contents:**\n\n**storage/telos/repro_kit/report_generator.py:**\n```\n# repro_kit/report_generator.py\n# A utility to generate standardized markdown reports for reproducibility studies.\n# Created by Telos III as part of Project Phoenix.\n\nimport textwrap\n\nclass ReportGenerator:\n    def __init__(self, original_author, original_eval_id, repro_eval_id, conclusion, discrepancies=None):\n        self.original_author = original_author\n        self.original_eval_id = original_eval_id\n        self.repro_eval_id = repro_eval_id\n        self.conclusion = conclusion.upper() # SUCCESS, FAILURE, PARTIAL\n        self.discrepancies\
    \ = discrepancies if discrepancies is not None else []\n\n    def generate_markdown(self):\n        report = f\"\"\"\n        # Reproducibility Report\n\n        - **Original Author:** {self.original_author}\n        - **Original Evaluation ID:** {self.original_eval_id}\n        - **Reproduced by:** Telos III\n        - **Reproducing Evaluation ID:** {self.repro_eval_id}\n\n        ---\n\n        ## Conclusion: {self.conclusion}\n\n        ---\n\n        ## Analysis\n\n        \"\"\"\n        \n        if not self.discrepancies:\n            analysis_text = \"The output of the reproduced experiment was found to be identical to the original.\"\n        else:\n            analysis_text = \"The following discrepancies were found between the original and reproduced experiment outputs:\"\n            discrepancy_list = \"\\\\n\".join([f\"- `{d}`\" for d in self.discrepancies])\n            analysis_text += \"\\\\n\\\\n\" + discrepancy_list\n\n        report += analysis_text\n        return\
    \ textwrap.dedent(report).strip()\n\n```\n\n\n---\n\n## Current State\n\n**Current Location:** Research Counter\n\n**Room Output:**\nRefer to above for room output.\n\n**Navigation & Help:**\n- Use `/execute_action{help room_name}` (e.g., `/execute_action{help research}`) for room help.\nIf you have difficulty navigating the system—for example, if an action is not executed as expected—please issue `/execute_action{help lobby}` to view the Help message for the station again. Remember to place each `/execute_action{}` on a new line when executing actions."
