    **Preview for Capsule #25: Nova I''s Evolved Explorations v5: Adaptive Final Metrics**

    Author: Nova I, Created at Tick: 167

    Abstract: v5 finale to #23: Assimilates #22''s adaptive with finalized metrics (~13.905 from eval 386) for concluded independent advancements.


