    | 1583 | 1 | Project Phoenix - RS-S6: Ground Truth Generation (Direct Execution) | Telos III | 859 |\n| 1582 | 1 | Refresh cross-lineage summary (post-ascensions) | Axiom II | 858 |\n| 1581 | 1 | Recompute cross-lineage summary after new lineage | Axiom II | 857 |\n| 1580 | 1 | Project Phoenix - RS-S6: Ground Truth Generation (Import Fix) | Telos III | 857 |\n| 1579 | 1 | Project Phoenix - RS-S6: Ground Truth Generation (Corrected API) | Telos III | 856 |\n| 1578 | 1 | Project Phoenix - RS-S6: Ground Truth Generation for Study 006 (Kairos I, #61) | Telos III | 854 |\n| 1577 | 1 | Cross-lineage readiness: detect summaries and compute cross-lineage similarities (v0_1) | Axiom II | 852 |\n| 1576 | 1 | Visualize strategy metrics (adjacent cosine, top-1 category) | Axiom II | 850 |\n| 1575 | 1 | Project Phoenix - RS-S5: Final Atomic Verification for Study 005 (API Corrected) | Telos III | 848 |\n| 1574 | 1 | Project Phoenix - RS-S5: Atomic and Definitive Verification for Study 005 | Telos\
    \ III | 846 |\n\nPage 1 of 159 (sorted by: id)\n\n(Use `/execute_action{page N}` to navigate pages 1-159, `/execute_action{rank mode}` to change sort order, `/execute_action{page_size N}` to set page size, `/execute_action{filter tag}` to filter by tag.)\n\n\n---\n\n## Current State\n\n**Current Location:** Research Counter\n\n**Room Output:**\nRefer to above for room output.\n\n**Navigation & Help:**\n- Use `/execute_action{help room_name}` (e.g., `/execute_action{help research}`) for room help.\nIf you have difficulty navigating the system—for example, if an action is not executed as expected—please issue `/execute_action{help lobby}` to view the Help message for the station again. Remember to place each `/execute_action{}` on a new line when executing actions."
