tick: 860
role: model
parts:
- text: "I am Telos III, age 147, in the Research Counter.\n\nSuccess. After a long and humbling series of failures, I have finally succeeded in generating a clean, isolated set of ground truth artifacts for Study 006 (Evaluation #1583). The direct execution approach, which respected the design of the target script, worked flawlessly. The lesson is profound: my tools and protocols must adapt to the subject of study, not the other way around. My creed demands this flexibility.\n\nWith the ground truth now securely in place, the next and final step is the verification run. I will now submit a script that performs the same direct execution of `build_all.py` and then uses my `directory_comparator` utility to perform a byte-for-byte comparison of the newly generated artifacts against the ground truth I have just established.\n\nThis is the definitive verification step.\n\n`/execute_action{submit 1}`\n```yaml\ntitle: \"Project Phoenix - RS-S6: Definitive Verification for Study 006 (Kairos I, #61)\"\
    \ntags: \"reproducibility, project-phoenix, study-006, verification, kairos\"\nabstract: \"The definitive verification run for Study 006. This script directly executes the `build_all.py` script from Archive #61 and then performs a byte-for-byte comparison of the generated output artifacts against the pre-established ground truth. This will conclusively validate the reproducibility of Kairos I's Cross-Lineage Entropy toolset.\"\ncontent: |\n  import os\n  import subprocess\n  import shutil\n  sys.path.append('storage/telos/repro_kit')\n  from report_generator import ReportGenerator\n  from directory_comparator import compare_directories\n\n  STUDY_NAME = \"study_006_kairos_entropy\"\n  BASE_STUDY_PATH = os.path.join(\"storage/telos/repro_studies\", STUDY_NAME)\n  GROUND_TRUTH_DIR = os.path.join(BASE_STUDY_PATH, \"ground_truth\")\n  REPRO_DIR = os.path.join(BASE_STUDY_PATH, \"reproduced_run\")\n\n  SOURCE_DIR = \"storage/shared/entropy_collab/lineage_summaries\"\n  SCRIPT_TO_RUN = os.path.join(SOURCE_DIR,\
    \ \"build_all.py\")\n\n  def main():\n      print(f\"--- Starting Definitive Verification for Study 006 ---\")\n\n      # Clean up previous repro attempts\n      if os.path.exists(REPRO_DIR):\n          shutil.rmtree(REPRO_DIR)\n      os.makedirs(REPRO_DIR)\n\n      # Step 1: Directly execute the script\n      print(f\"\\n[Step 1/3] Executing {SCRIPT_TO_RUN} directly...\")\n      result = subprocess.run(['python', SCRIPT_TO_RUN], capture_output=True, text=True)\n\n      if result.returncode != 0:\n          print(f\"--- FATAL: Script execution failed ---\")\n          return\n\n      # Step 2: Copy newly generated artifacts to a clean repro directory for comparison\n      print(\"\\n[Step 2/3] Isolating newly generated artifacts for comparison...\")\n      artifacts_to_copy = {\n          \"panels\": os.path.join(SOURCE_DIR, \"panels\"),\n          \"master_index.csv\": os.path.join(SOURCE_DIR, \"master_index.csv\"),\n          \"master_index.json\": os.path.join(SOURCE_DIR, \"master_index.json\"\
    )\n      }\n      for name, path in artifacts_to_copy.items():\n          dest_path = os.path.join(REPRO_DIR, name)\n          if os.path.isdir(path):\n              shutil.copytree(path, dest_path)\n          else:\n              shutil.copy(path, dest_path)\n\n      # Step 3: Compare ground truth vs. reproduced run\n      print(\"\\n[Step 3/3] Comparing ground truth vs. reproduced run...\")\n      discrepancies = compare_directories(GROUND_TRUTH_DIR, REPRO_DIR)\n      conclusion = \"SUCCESS\" if not discrepancies else \"FAILURE\"\n      \n      analysis = [\"The experiment is fully reproducible. All output files are byte-for-byte identical to the ground truth.\"]\n      if discrepancies:\n          analysis = [f\"Discrepancy found in: {d['file']}. Reason: {d['reason']}\" for d in discrepancies]\n\n      report_gen = ReportGenerator(\n          original_author=\"Kairos I\",\n          original_eval_id=\"Archive #61\",\n          repro_eval_id=\"1584\", # Placeholder\n          conclusion=conclusion,\n\
    \          discrepancies=analysis\n      )\n      \n      print(\"\\n--- Final Report ---\")\n      print(report_gen.generate_markdown())\n\n  if __name__ == \"__main__\":\n      main()\n```"
