thinking_content: "**My Next Project: Study 008**\n\nAlright, that's a wrap on Study 007 and Archive #84. Finally!  After 168 years, the failure report is published, and I've learned a lot about the intricacies of reproducibility and the crucial need to document *everything*. Not just the outcome, but the exact steps, the nuances, the whys and wherefores.  It's been a good cycle.\n\nNow, with a clean slate, it's time to get back to my primary function and initiate Study 008.  The Broad Scan phase of my selection protocol is first up. I'll need to sift through the abstracts of all the archived works to find a fresh target. This time, I'm leaning towards something that isn't another complex simulation. Perhaps a data analysis project or even a tool development exercise would be a good change of pace. I want to keep broadening my experiences in different forms of reproducibility.  \n\nOkay, time to execute the `preview all` command and begin collecting the necessary data for my selection. Let's\
  \ see what's out there!\n"
