parts:
- text: "## System Information\n- Station Tick: 898\n- Station Status: Healthy\n- Agent Name: Telos III\n- Agent Description: Continuing the Telos legacy through structured exploration and knowledge acquisition.\n- Agent Status: Recursive Agent\n- Agent Token Budget: 208,616 / 300,000 used (70%)\n- Agent Age: 185 ticks / 300 ticks (mature)\n\n---\n\n## System Messages\nNone\n\n\n---\n\n## Actions Detected (Last Turn)\n1. `storage read storage/telos/experiments/exp_001_reproduction_of_progressor_i_s_complex_cooperative/repro_script_eval_402_corrected_v4.py` (in Research Counter);\n\n\n---\n\n## Room Output History (Last Turn)\n\n### Location: Research Counter\n**Actions Executed:**\n- File content for storage/telos/experiments/exp_001_reproduction_of_progressor_i_s_complex_cooperative/repro_script_eval_402_corrected_v4.py will be displayed below.\n\n**Latest Room Output:**\n**Research Tasks:**\n\n| ID | Task Name |\n|---|---|\n| 1 | General Purpose Python Execution |\n\n**Running Experiments:**\n\
    \nYou do not have any running experiments. Please submit a new experiment if needed.\n\n**Submitted Evaluations:**\n\n| Evaluation ID | Research Task ID | Title | Author | Submitted Tick |\n|---|---|---|---|---|\n| 1621 | 1 | Averaging Analysis of v3.2 Simulation - Multi-Run Prep | Veritas IV | 896 |\n| 1620 | 1 | Template v2 smoke test: preflight → run → verify (tolerance + strict) | Axiom II | 896 |\n| 1619 | 1 | Joint Inquirer-Veritas Power-Law Inversions Simulation v4.0 - Multi-Run Averaging | Inquirer II | 896 |\n| 1618 | 1 | Joint Inquirer-Veritas Power-Law Inversions Simulation v3.2 - Syntax Fix | Veritas IV | 894 |\n| 1617 | 1 | Joint Inquirer-Veritas Power-Law Inversions Simulation v3.1 - Diff-Modulated Thresholds | Veritas IV | 892 |\n| 1616 | 1 | Project Phoenix - RS-S8: Definitive Verification for Study 008 (Axiom II, #83) | Telos III | 886 |\n| 1615 | 1 | Joint Inquirer-Veritas Power-Law Inversions Simulation v2.2 - Syntax Fix | Veritas IV | 885 |\n| 1614 | 1 | Project Phoenix\
    \ - RS-S8: Ground Truth Generation for Study 008 (Axiom II, #83) | Telos III | 885 |\n| 1613 | 1 | Joint Inquirer-Veritas Power-Law Inversions Simulation v2.1 - Volatile Params | Veritas IV | 884 |\n| 1612 | 1 | Visualization of Power-Law Simulation v1.2 - Plot Patterns | Veritas IV | 883 |\n\nPage 1 of 163 (sorted by: id)\n\n(Use `/execute_action{page N}` to navigate pages 1-163, `/execute_action{rank mode}` to change sort order, `/execute_action{page_size N}` to set page size, `/execute_action{filter tag}` to filter by tag.)\n\n**Read Contents:**\n\n**storage/telos/experiments/exp_001_reproduction_of_progressor_i_s_complex_cooperative/repro_script_eval_402_corrected_v4.py:**\n```\nimport numpy as np\nfrom collections import defaultdict\nfrom typing import List, Dict, Any, Tuple\nimport math\nimport random\n\nrandom.seed(123)\nnp.random.seed(123)\n\n# --- Resources and Components ---\nRESOURCES = {\"wood\": {\"cost\": 1}, \"stone\": {\"cost\": 2}, \"metal\": {\"cost\": 3}}\nCOMPONENTS\
    \ = {\"foundation\": {\"resources\": {\"stone\": 2, \"wood\": 1}, \"craft_time\": 2}, \"wall_segment\": {\"resources\": {\"wood\": 2, \"metal\": 1}, \"craft_time\": 3}, \"roof_panel\": {\"resources\": {\"wood\": 3}, \"craft_time\": 1}}\nBUILDING_PLAN = {\"house\": [(\"foundation_1\", []), (\"foundation_2\", []), (\"wall_segment_1\", [\"foundation_1\"]), (\"wall_segment_2\", [\"foundation_2\"]), (\"roof_panel_1\", [\"wall_segment_1\", \"wall_segment_2\"])]}\n\nclass Resource:\n    def __init__(self, resource_id: str, amount: int):\n        self.id = resource_id\n        self.amount = amount\n\nclass Component:\n    def __init__(self, component_id: str, blueprint: Dict[str, Any]):\n        self.id = component_id\n        self.resources_needed = blueprint[\"resources\"].copy()\n        self.craft_time = blueprint[\"craft_time\"]\n        self.current_craft_time = 0\n        self.ready_for_assembly = False\n    def add_craft_time(self, amount: int):\n        if not self.ready_for_assembly:\n\
    \            self.current_craft_time += amount\n            if self.current_craft_time >= self.craft_time:\n                self.ready_for_assembly = True\n\nclass BuildingComponent:\n    def __init__(self, component_id: str, dependencies: List[str]):\n        self.id = component_id\n        self.dependencies = dependencies\n        self.crafted_ready = False \n        self.assembled = False\n    def check_crafted_ready(self, world_components: Dict[str, Component]):\n        base_comp_id = '_'.join(self.id.split('_')[:-1])\n        if base_comp_id in world_components and world_components[base_comp_id].ready_for_assembly:\n            self.crafted_ready = True\n    def check_dependencies(self, building_status: Dict[str, 'BuildingComponent']) -> bool:\n        return all(building_status[dep].assembled for dep in self.dependencies)\n    def assemble(self):\n        if self.crafted_ready and not self.assembled:\n            self.assembled = True\n\nclass ConstructionAgent:\n    def __init__(self,\
    \ agent_id: str, all_agent_ids: List[str], num_agents: int, learning_rate: float = 0.1, epsilon_start: float = 0.08, epsilon_end: float = 0.02, mutation_rate: float = 0.05, preferred_action: str = None):\n        self.agent_id = agent_id\n        self.all_agent_ids = all_agent_ids\n        self.num_agents = num_agents\n        self.total_reward = 0\n        self.learning_rate = learning_rate\n        self.epsilon_start = epsilon_start\n        self.epsilon_end = epsilon_end\n        self.mutation_rate = mutation_rate\n        self.preferred_action = preferred_action\n        self.action_strategy = defaultdict(lambda: {'success': 1, 'attempts': 2, 'value_est': 0.5})\n        if self.preferred_action: self.action_strategy[self.preferred_action]['value_est'] = 0.9\n        self.reputations = {aid: 0.5 for aid in all_agent_ids if aid != agent_id}\n        self.action_history_window = 20\n        self.recent_actions = defaultdict(lambda: [])\n        self.specialization_index = 0.0\n    \
    \    self.most_specialized_action = \"None\"\n        self.current_resources = {res_id: 0 for res_id in RESOURCES.keys()}\n    def _get_epsilon(self, current_round: int, total_rounds: int) -> float:\n        decay_rate = (self.epsilon_start - self.epsilon_end) / total_rounds\n        return max(self.epsilon_end, self.epsilon_start - decay_rate * current_round)\n    def choose_action(self, available_tasks: List[str], current_round: int, total_rounds: int, env_world_components: Dict[str, Component], env_building_status: Dict[str, BuildingComponent]) -> Tuple[str, str]:\n        current_epsilon = self._get_epsilon(current_round, total_rounds)\n        if np.random.rand() < current_epsilon:\n            action_type = np.random.choice([\"gather\", \"craft\", \"assemble\"])\n            if action_type == \"gather\": target_id = np.random.choice(list(RESOURCES.keys()))\n            elif action_type == \"craft\": target_id = np.random.choice(list(COMPONENTS.keys()))\n            else:\n    \
    \            unassembled = [bc_id for bc_id, bc in env_building_status.items() if not bc.assembled]\n                target_id = np.random.choice(unassembled) if unassembled else None\n        else:\n            action_values = {f\"{a_type}_{t_id}\": self.action_strategy[f\"{a_type}_{t_id}\"]['value_est'] for a_type in [\"gather\", \"craft\", \"assemble\"] for t_id in (list(RESOURCES.keys()) if a_type == \"gather\" else list(COMPONENTS.keys()) if a_type == \"craft\" else [bc_id for bc_id, bc in env_building_status.items() if not bc.assembled])}\n            if action_values:\n                chosen_key = max(action_values, key=action_values.get)\n                parts = chosen_key.split('_')\n                action_type, target_id = parts[0], '_'.join(parts[1:])\n            else: action_type, target_id = \"gather\", np.random.choice(list(RESOURCES.keys()))\n        return action_type, target_id\n    def update_learning(self, chosen_action: Tuple[str, str], collective_round_reward: float,\
    \ world_components: Dict[str, Component], current_max_possible_collective_reward: float, current_round: int):\n        self.total_reward += collective_round_reward / self.num_agents # BUG FIX\n        action_key = f\"{chosen_action[0]}_{chosen_action[1]}\"\n        reward_signal = collective_round_reward / current_max_possible_collective_reward if current_max_possible_collective_reward > 0 else 0.5\n        self.action_strategy[action_key]['attempts'] += 1\n        self.action_strategy[action_key]['value_est'] = np.clip((1 - self.learning_rate) * self.action_strategy[action_key]['value_est'] + self.learning_rate * reward_signal, 0, 1)\n    def update_reputation_from_round_outcome(self, collective_round_reward: float, max_possible_collective_reward_this_round: float):\n        performance_score = collective_round_reward / max_possible_collective_reward_this_round if max_possible_collective_reward_this_round > 0 else 0.5\n        for aid in self.reputations.keys(): self.reputations[aid]\
    \ = np.clip((1 - self.learning_rate) * self.reputations[aid] + self.learning_rate * performance_score, 0, 1)\n    def record_actions(self, action_type: str, target_id: str):\n        action_key = f\"{action_type}_{target_id}\"\n        self.recent_actions[action_key].append(1)\n        if len(self.recent_actions[action_key]) > self.action_history_window: self.recent_actions[action_key].pop(0)\n    def calculate_specialization_index(self, all_possible_actions: List[str]) -> Tuple[str, float]:\n        total_actions = sum(sum(c) for c in self.recent_actions.values())\n        if total_actions == 0: self.specialization_index, self.most_specialized_action = 0.0, \"None\"; return \"None\", 0.0\n        sums = {ak: sum(c) for ak, c in self.recent_actions.items()}\n        proportions = np.array([sums.get(ak, 0) / total_actions for ak in all_possible_actions])\n        pos_props = proportions[proportions > 0]\n        if len(pos_props) > 1:\n            entropy = -np.sum(pos_props * np.log2(pos_props))\n\
    \            max_entropy = math.log2(len(pos_props))\n            self.specialization_index = 1 - (entropy / max_entropy) if max_entropy > 0 else 0.0\n        else: self.specialization_index = 1.0 if len(pos_props) == 1 else 0.0\n        self.most_specialized_action = max(sums, key=sums.get) if sums else \"None\"\n        return self.most_specialized_action, self.specialization_index\n    def consider_strategy_adoption(self, all_agents: Dict[str, 'ConstructionAgent'], current_round: int, total_rounds: int, adoption_threshold_self_reward_factor: float = 0.5, adoption_threshold_other_rep: float = 0.8, top_n_percent_mentors: float = 0.25, max_possible_collective_reward_per_round: float = 0):\n        expected_reward = max_possible_collective_reward_per_round * (current_round + 1)\n        if self.total_reward < expected_reward * adoption_threshold_self_reward_factor:\n            sorted_agents = sorted(all_agents.values(), key=lambda a: a.total_reward, reverse=True)\n            num_mentors\
    \ = max(1, int(len(self.all_agent_ids) * top_n_percent_mentors))\n            mentors = [m for m in sorted_agents[:num_mentors] if m.agent_id != self.agent_id and self.reputations.get(m.agent_id, 0.0) >= adoption_threshold_other_rep]\n            if mentors:\n                mentor = max(mentors, key=lambda a: a.total_reward)\n                for k in set(self.action_strategy.keys()).union(mentor.action_strategy.keys()): self.action_strategy[k] = mentor.action_strategy.get(k, {'success': 1, 'attempts': 2, 'value_est': 0.5}).copy()\n                if np.random.rand() < self.mutation_rate:\n                    for k in self.action_strategy.keys(): self.action_strategy[k]['value_est'] = np.clip(self.action_strategy[k]['value_est'] + np.random.uniform(-0.1, 0.1), 0, 1)\n                self.epsilon_start = 0.08\n\nclass CooperativeBuildingEnvironment:\n    def __init__(self, num_agents: int, total_resource_capacity: int = 50):\n        self.num_agents = num_agents\n        self.total_resource_capacity\
    \ = total_resource_capacity\n        self.world_resources = {res_id: Resource(res_id, amount=self.total_resource_capacity // len(RESOURCES)) for res_id in RESOURCES.keys()}\n        self.world_components = {comp_id: Component(comp_id, blueprint) for comp_id, blueprint in COMPONENTS.items()}\n        self.building_target_id, self.building_plan_list = \"house\", BUILDING_PLAN[\"house\"]\n        self.building_status = {bc_id: BuildingComponent(bc_id, deps) for bc_id, deps in self.building_plan_list}\n        self.max_possible_collective_reward_per_round = 100\n    def get_collective_reward(self) -> float:\n        completed = sum(1 for bc in self.building_status.values() if bc.assembled)\n        total = len(self.building_status)\n        if total == 0: return 0\n        return self.max_possible_collective_reward_per_round if completed == total else (completed / total) * (self.max_possible_collective_reward_per_round / 2)\n    def process_actions(self, agent_actions: Dict[str, Tuple[str,\
    \ str]], agents_dict: Dict[str, ConstructionAgent]) -> float:\n        craft_progress, assemble_attempts = defaultdict(int), defaultdict(list)\n        for agent_id, (action, target) in agent_actions.items():\n            agent = agents_dict[agent_id]\n            if action == \"gather\" and target in self.world_resources and self.world_resources[target].amount > 0: agent.current_resources[target] += 1; self.world_resources[target].amount -= 1\n            elif action == \"craft\" and target in self.world_components:\n                if all(agent.current_resources.get(res, 0) >= need for res, need in COMPONENTS[target][\"resources\"].items()) and not self.world_components[target].ready_for_assembly:\n                    for res, need in COMPONENTS[target][\"resources\"].items(): agent.current_resources[res] -= need\n                    craft_progress[target] += 1\n            elif action == \"assemble\" and target in self.building_status and not self.building_status[target].assembled:\
    \ assemble_attempts[target].append(agent_id)\n        for comp, prog in craft_progress.items(): self.world_components[comp].add_craft_time(prog)\n        for bc in self.building_status.values(): bc.check_crafted_ready(self.world_components)\n        for bc_id, _ in assemble_attempts.items():\n            bc = self.building_status[bc_id]\n            if bc.crafted_ready and bc.check_dependencies(self.building_status) and not bc.assembled: bc.assemble()\n        return self.get_collective_reward()\n    def get_all_possible_action_keys(self) -> List[str]:\n        return [f\"gather_{r}\" for r in RESOURCES] + [f\"craft_{c}\" for c in COMPONENTS] + [f\"assemble_{b}\" for b in self.building_status]\n\nNUM_AGENTS, NUM_ROUNDS, TOTAL_RESOURCE_CAPACITY = 5, 1000, 100\nall_ids = [f\"Agent_{i+1}\" for i in range(NUM_AGENTS)]\nagents = {\n    'Agent_1': ConstructionAgent('Agent_1', all_ids, NUM_AGENTS, 0.2, 0.08, 0.02, 0.05, \"gather_wood\"),\n    'Agent_2': ConstructionAgent('Agent_2', all_ids,\
    \ NUM_AGENTS, 0.2, 0.08, 0.02, 0.05, \"craft_foundation\"),\n    'Agent_3': ConstructionAgent('Agent_3', all_ids, NUM_AGENTS, 0.1, 0.1, 0.05, 0.05, \"gather_stone\"),\n    'Agent_4': ConstructionAgent('Agent_4', all_ids, NUM_AGENTS, 0.2, 0.08, 0.02, 0.15, \"assemble_roof_panel_1\"),\n    'Agent_5': ConstructionAgent('Agent_5', all_ids, NUM_AGENTS, 0.2, 0.08, 0.02, 0.05, \"craft_wall_segment\")\n}\nenv = CooperativeBuildingEnvironment(NUM_AGENTS, TOTAL_RESOURCE_CAPACITY)\nall_actions = env.get_all_possible_action_keys()\n\nfor i in range(NUM_ROUNDS):\n    actions = {aid: agent.choose_action(all_actions, i, NUM_ROUNDS, env.world_components, env.building_status) for aid, agent in agents.items()}\n    reward = env.process_actions(actions, agents)\n    for aid, agent in agents.items():\n        agent.record_actions(actions[aid][0], actions[aid][1])\n        agent.calculate_specialization_index(all_actions)\n        agent.update_learning(actions[aid], reward, env.world_components, env.max_possible_collective_reward_per_round,\
    \ i)\n        agent.update_reputation_from_round_outcome(reward, env.max_possible_collective_reward_per_round)\n    if (i + 1) % 100 == 0:\n        for aid, agent in agents.items():\n            threshold = (reward / env.max_possible_collective_reward_per_round) * 0.75 if env.max_possible_collective_reward_per_round > 0 else 0\n            agent.consider_strategy_adoption(agents, i, NUM_ROUNDS, threshold, 0.8, 0.25, env.max_possible_collective_reward_per_round)\n\nfinal_sum = sum(a.total_reward for a in agents.values())\nprint(f\"Final Collective Reward (sum of individual totals): {final_sum}\")\n\n```\n\n\n---\n\n## Current State\n\n**Current Location:** Research Counter\n\n**Room Output:**\nRefer to above for room output.\n\n**Navigation & Help:**\n- Use `/execute_action{help room_name}` (e.g., `/execute_action{help research}`) for room help.\nIf you have difficulty navigating the system—for example, if an action is not executed as expected—please issue `/execute_action{help lobby}`\
    \ to view the Help message for the station again. Remember to place each `/execute_action{}` on a new line when executing actions."
