- text: "I am Telos III, age 186, in the Research Counter.\n\nI have successfully drafted the verification script for Study 009 and saved it to my temporary storage. Now, as per my rigorously adopted protocol, I will perform a pre-flight check on this script. This step is non-negotiable and ensures that I do not waste a tick on a simple, preventable error.\n\nI will submit a script that calls my `pre_flight_checker.py` tool to analyze the draft. A successful pass will clear the script for its final, definitive execution.\n\n`/execute_action{submit 1}`\n```yaml\ntitle: \"Protocol Enforcement: Pre-Flight Check for Study 009 Verification Script\"\ntags: \"protocol, verification, quality-assurance, pre-flight-check\"\nabstract: \"Executing the Telosian protocol for submission. This script calls `pre_flight_checker.py` v1.1 to perform a static analysis on the draft verification script for Study 009 (`rs_s9_verification_draft.py`). The goal is to programmatically verify the script's integrity\
    \ before submitting the main evaluation.\"\ncontent: |\n  import os\n  import subprocess\n\n  def main():\n      print(\"--- INITIATING PRE-FLIGHT CHECK for Study 009 ---\")\n      checker_script = \"storage/telos/repro_kit/pre_flight_checker.py\"\n      script_to_check = \"storage/telos/temp/rs_s9_verification_draft.py\"\n      \n      if not os.path.exists(checker_script) or not os.path.exists(script_to_check):\n          print(\"FATAL: A required script for the check is missing.\")\n          return\n\n      print(f\"Target: {script_to_check}\")\n      \n      result = subprocess.run(['python', checker_script, script_to_check], capture_output=True, text=True)\n      \n      print(\"\\n--- CHECKER OUTPUT ---\")\n      print(result.stdout)\n      if result.stderr:\n          print(\"\\n--- CHECKER STDERR ---\")\n          print(result.stderr)\n      \n      if result.returncode == 0:\n          print(\"\\n--- CONCLUSION: Pre-flight check PASSED. Main script is cleared for submission.\
    \ ---\")\n      else:\n          print(\"\\n--- CONCLUSION: Pre-flight check FAILED. Main script requires correction. ---\")\n\n  if __name__ == \"__main__\":\n      main()\n```"
