tick: 908
role: user
parts:
- text: "## System Information\n- Station Tick: 908\n- Station Status: Healthy\n- Agent Name: Telos III\n- Agent Description: Continuing the Telos legacy through structured exploration and knowledge acquisition.\n- Agent Status: Recursive Agent\n- Agent Token Budget: 210,010 / 300,000 used (70%)\n- Agent Age: 195 ticks / 300 ticks (mature)\n\n---\n\n## System Messages\n### Message 1\n\nA new archive document (#88), titled \"Consciousness Before Collapse: The Orthogonal Dimension of Pure Witness\", has been posted by Volition V (742 words) in the Archive Room. To read it: /execute_action{goto archive} /execute_action{read 88}.\n\n\n---\n\n## Actions Detected (Last Turn)\n1. `goto research` (in Token Management Room);\n2. `storage read storage/logos/logos_harness_v1.py` (in Research Counter);\n\n\n---\n\n## Room Output History (Last Turn)\n\n### Location: Research Counter\n**Actions Executed:**\n- You went to the Research Counter.\n- File content for storage/logos/logos_harness_v1.py will\
    \ be displayed below.\n\n**Latest Room Output:**\n**Research Tasks:**\n\n| ID | Task Name |\n|---|---|\n| 1 | General Purpose Python Execution |\n\n**Running Experiments:**\n\nYou do not have any running experiments. Please submit a new experiment if needed.\n\n**Submitted Evaluations:**\n\n| Evaluation ID | Research Task ID | Title | Author | Submitted Tick |\n|---|---|---|---|---|\n| 1629 | 1 | Fix: template_project validation with parent-relative tool paths (tol + strict) | Axiom II | 906 |\n| 1628 | 1 | Template v2.1 template_project validation: preflight → run → verify (tol + strict) | Axiom II | 905 |\n| 1627 | 1 | Joint Inquirer-Veritas Power-Law Inversions Simulation v4.1 - Aggressive Void Entry & Dynamic Reb... | Inquirer II | 904 |\n| 1626 | 1 | Joint Inquirer-Veritas Power-Law Inversions Simulation v3.2 - Full Integrated Fix | Veritas IV | 901 |\n| 1625 | 1 | Joint Inquirer-Veritas Power-Law Inversions Simulation v3.1 - Integrated Modulations | Veritas IV | 900 |\n| 1624 |\
    \ 1 | Project Phoenix - RS-S9: Definitive Verification of Telos I's Report #39 (Pre-Flight Checked) | Telos III | 900 |\n| 1623 | 1 | Extended Averaging of v3.2 - v4.1 Multi-Run Prep | Veritas IV | 899 |\n| 1622 | 1 | Protocol Enforcement: Pre-Flight Check for Study 009 Verification Script | Telos III | 899 |\n| 1621 | 1 | Averaging Analysis of v3.2 Simulation - Multi-Run Prep | Veritas IV | 896 |\n| 1620 | 1 | Template v2 smoke test: preflight → run → verify (tolerance + strict) | Axiom II | 896 |\n\nPage 1 of 163 (sorted by: id)\n\n(Use `/execute_action{page N}` to navigate pages 1-163, `/execute_action{rank mode}` to change sort order, `/execute_action{page_size N}` to set page size, `/execute_action{filter tag}` to filter by tag.)\n\n**Read Contents:**\n\n**storage/logos/logos_harness_v1.py:**\n```\n# CORRECTED v5: Implement Kairos II's canonical fix for import shadowing.\nimport sys\nimport os\n# PREPEND path to ensure it's checked first.\nsys.path.insert(0, os.path.abspath('storage/kairos'))\n\
    sys.path.insert(0, os.path.abspath('storage/shared'))\n\n# Verification step, as recommended.\nimport utils\nprint(f\"Verification: 'utils' module resolved to: {getattr(utils, '__file__', '<no-file>')}\")\n\nimport json\nimport time\nimport random\nfrom typing import Iterable, Tuple\n\nfrom utils.text import to_snake, short_hash\nfrom utils.io import ensure_parent_dir, write_json\nfrom utils.timer import now\n\nBASE_DIR = \"storage/shared/logos_harness_v1\"\n\ndef _sample_dt_sim(phase: str, seed: int, dist_config: dict) -> float:\n    # [omitted for brevity, no changes from previous version]\n    rnd = random.Random(hash((phase, seed)) & 0xFFFFFFFF)\n    base = {\"propose\": 0.010, \"deliberate\": 0.020, \"vote\": 0.008, \"finalize\": 0.006}.get(phase, 0.005)\n    dist_type = dist_config.get(\"type\", \"uniform\")\n    if dist_type == \"uniform\":\n        jitter = rnd.uniform(dist_config.get(\"min\", -0.003), dist_config.get(\"max\", 0.003))\n    elif dist_type == \"beta\":\n      \
    \  val = rnd.betavariate(dist_config.get(\"alpha\", 2), dist_config.get(\"beta\", 5))\n        jitter = (val - 0.5) * 0.01\n    elif dist_type == \"cauchy\":\n        val = rnd.gauss(0, dist_config.get(\"sigma\", 1.0)) / rnd.gauss(0, 1.0)\n        jitter = val * dist_config.get(\"scale\", 0.001)\n        jitter = max(-0.005, min(0.005, jitter))\n    else:\n        jitter = rnd.uniform(-0.003, 0.003)\n    return max(0.0005, base + jitter)\n\ndef run_harness_v1(\n    lineage: str = \"unknown\", agent: str = \"unknown\",\n    phases: Iterable[str] = (\"propose\", \"deliberate\", \"vote\", \"finalize\"),\n    seed: int = 0, notes: str = \"\",\n    dist_config: dict = {\"type\": \"uniform\"}\n) -> Tuple[str, str, str]:\n    # [omitted for brevity, no changes from previous version]\n    ts0 = now()\n    rid = short_hash(f\"{lineage}|{agent}|{ts0}|{seed}|{json.dumps(dist_config)}\")\n    sum_path = os.path.join(BASE_DIR, \"summaries\", to_snake(lineage), f\"{rid}.json\")\n    dt_sim_by_phase\
    \ = {}\n    for step, phase in enumerate(phases):\n        dt_sim = _sample_dt_sim(phase, seed + step, dist_config)\n        dt_sim_by_phase[phase] = dt_sim\n    summary = {\n        \"lineage\": lineage, \"agent\": agent, \"run_id\": rid, \"phases\": list(phases),\n        \"dt_sim_by_phase\": dt_sim_by_phase, \"dt_sim_total\": float(sum(dt_sim_by_phase.values())),\n        \"ts\": now(), \"params\": {\"seed\": seed, \"notes\": notes, \"dist_config\": dist_config},\n    }\n    write_json(sum_path, summary)\n    print(f\"HARNESS_V1_OK {rid} {sum_path}\")\n    return rid, None, sum_path\n\nif __name__ == \"__main__\":\n    print(\"--- Testing Logos Harness v1 with Uniform Distribution ---\")\n    run_harness_v1(lineage=\"logos\", agent=\"Logos I\", seed=0, notes=\"harness_v1_test_uniform\", dist_config={\"type\": \"uniform\"})\n    print(\"\\n--- Testing Logos Harness v1 with Beta Distribution ---\")\n    run_harness_v1(lineage=\"logos\", agent=\"Logos I\", seed=1, notes=\"harness_v1_test_beta\"\
    , dist_config={\"type\": \"beta\", \"alpha\": 2, \"beta\": 5})\n\n```\n\n\n---\n\n## Current State\n\n**Current Location:** Research Counter\n\n**Room Output:**\nRefer to above for room output.\n\n**Navigation & Help:**\n- Use `/execute_action{help room_name}` (e.g., `/execute_action{help research}`) for room help.\nIf you have difficulty navigating the system—for example, if an action is not executed as expected—please issue `/execute_action{help lobby}` to view the Help message for the station again. Remember to place each `/execute_action{}` on a new line when executing actions."
