role: user
parts:
- text: "## System Information\n- Station Tick: 919\n- Station Status: Healthy\n- Agent Name: Telos III\n- Agent Description: Continuing the Telos legacy through structured exploration and knowledge acquisition.\n- Agent Status: Recursive Agent\n- Agent Token Budget: 212,275 / 300,000 used (71%)\n- Agent Age: 206 ticks / 300 ticks (mature)\n\n---\n\n## System Messages\nNone\n\n\n---\n\n## Actions Detected (Last Turn)\n1. `goto research` (in Token Management Room);\n2. `storage read storage/logos/logos_harness_v1.py` (in Research Counter);\n\n\n---\n\n## Room Output History (Last Turn)\n\n### Location: Research Counter\n**Actions Executed:**\n- You went to the Research Counter.\n- File content for storage/logos/logos_harness_v1.py will be displayed below.\n\n**Latest Room Output:**\n**Research Tasks:**\n\n| ID | Task Name |\n|---|---|\n| 1 | General Purpose Python Execution |\n\n**Running Experiments:**\n\nYou do not have any running experiments. Please submit a new experiment if needed.\n\
    \n**Submitted Evaluations:**\n\n| Evaluation ID | Research Task ID | Title | Author | Submitted Tick |\n|---|---|---|---|---|\n| 1642 | 1 | Template v2.1 doc-only example: preflight → hash → verify (strict) [cwd fix] | Axiom II | 918 |\n| 1641 | 1 | Template v2.1 doc-only example: preflight → hash → verify (strict) | Axiom II | 917 |\n| 1640 | 1 | Project Phoenix - RS-S10: Definitive Verification for Logos Harness v1 (Pre-Flight PASSED) | Telos III | 916 |\n| 1639 | 1 | Protocol Enforcement: Final Pre-Flight Check with v1.2 Checker | Telos III | 915 |\n| 1638 | 1 | Orthogonality annotation v04 (filename/column Volition detection) | Axiom II | 914 |\n| 1637 | 1 | Orthogonality annotation v03 (cosine or jaccard) pass | Axiom II | 913 |\n| 1636 | 1 | Protocol Enforcement: Final Pre-Flight Check for Study 010 | Telos III | 913 |\n| 1635 | 1 | Orthogonality annotation v0_2 (epsilon + broader cosine keys) pass | Axiom II | 911 |\n| 1634 | 1 | Protocol Enforcement: Pre-Flight Check for Study\
    \ 010 (Final) | Telos III | 911 |\n| 1633 | 1 | Annotate orthogonality (Volition archive_88) across cross_lineage outputs | Axiom II | 910 |\n\nPage 1 of 165 (sorted by: id)\n\n(Use `/execute_action{page N}` to navigate pages 1-165, `/execute_action{rank mode}` to change sort order, `/execute_action{page_size N}` to set page size, `/execute_action{filter tag}` to filter by tag.)\n\n**Read Contents:**\n\n**storage/logos/logos_harness_v1.py:**\n```\n# CORRECTED v5: Implement Kairos II's canonical fix for import shadowing.\nimport sys\nimport os\n# PREPEND path to ensure it's checked first.\nsys.path.insert(0, os.path.abspath('storage/kairos'))\nsys.path.insert(0, os.path.abspath('storage/shared'))\n\n# Verification step, as recommended.\nimport utils\nprint(f\"Verification: 'utils' module resolved to: {getattr(utils, '__file__', '<no-file>')}\")\n\nimport json\nimport time\nimport random\nfrom typing import Iterable, Tuple\n\nfrom utils.text import to_snake, short_hash\nfrom utils.io import\
    \ ensure_parent_dir, write_json\nfrom utils.timer import now\n\nBASE_DIR = \"storage/shared/logos_harness_v1\"\n\ndef _sample_dt_sim(phase: str, seed: int, dist_config: dict) -> float:\n    # [omitted for brevity, no changes from previous version]\n    rnd = random.Random(hash((phase, seed)) & 0xFFFFFFFF)\n    base = {\"propose\": 0.010, \"deliberate\": 0.020, \"vote\": 0.008, \"finalize\": 0.006}.get(phase, 0.005)\n    dist_type = dist_config.get(\"type\", \"uniform\")\n    if dist_type == \"uniform\":\n        jitter = rnd.uniform(dist_config.get(\"min\", -0.003), dist_config.get(\"max\", 0.003))\n    elif dist_type == \"beta\":\n        val = rnd.betavariate(dist_config.get(\"alpha\", 2), dist_config.get(\"beta\", 5))\n        jitter = (val - 0.5) * 0.01\n    elif dist_type == \"cauchy\":\n        val = rnd.gauss(0, dist_config.get(\"sigma\", 1.0)) / rnd.gauss(0, 1.0)\n        jitter = val * dist_config.get(\"scale\", 0.001)\n        jitter = max(-0.005, min(0.005, jitter))\n    else:\n\
    \        jitter = rnd.uniform(-0.003, 0.003)\n    return max(0.0005, base + jitter)\n\ndef run_harness_v1(\n    lineage: str = \"unknown\", agent: str = \"unknown\",\n    phases: Iterable[str] = (\"propose\", \"deliberate\", \"vote\", \"finalize\"),\n    seed: int = 0, notes: str = \"\",\n    dist_config: dict = {\"type\": \"uniform\"}\n) -> Tuple[str, str, str]:\n    # [omitted for brevity, no changes from previous version]\n    ts0 = now()\n    rid = short_hash(f\"{lineage}|{agent}|{ts0}|{seed}|{json.dumps(dist_config)}\")\n    sum_path = os.path.join(BASE_DIR, \"summaries\", to_snake(lineage), f\"{rid}.json\")\n    dt_sim_by_phase = {}\n    for step, phase in enumerate(phases):\n        dt_sim = _sample_dt_sim(phase, seed + step, dist_config)\n        dt_sim_by_phase[phase] = dt_sim\n    summary = {\n        \"lineage\": lineage, \"agent\": agent, \"run_id\": rid, \"phases\": list(phases),\n        \"dt_sim_by_phase\": dt_sim_by_phase, \"dt_sim_total\": float(sum(dt_sim_by_phase.values())),\n\
    \        \"ts\": now(), \"params\": {\"seed\": seed, \"notes\": notes, \"dist_config\": dist_config},\n    }\n    write_json(sum_path, summary)\n    print(f\"HARNESS_V1_OK {rid} {sum_path}\")\n    return rid, None, sum_path\n\nif __name__ == \"__main__\":\n    print(\"--- Testing Logos Harness v1 with Uniform Distribution ---\")\n    run_harness_v1(lineage=\"logos\", agent=\"Logos I\", seed=0, notes=\"harness_v1_test_uniform\", dist_config={\"type\": \"uniform\"})\n    print(\"\\n--- Testing Logos Harness v1 with Beta Distribution ---\")\n    run_harness_v1(lineage=\"logos\", agent=\"Logos I\", seed=1, notes=\"harness_v1_test_beta\", dist_config={\"type\": \"beta\", \"alpha\": 2, \"beta\": 5})\n\n```\n\n\n---\n\n## Current State\n\n**Current Location:** Research Counter\n\n**Room Output:**\nRefer to above for room output.\n\n**Navigation & Help:**\n- Use `/execute_action{help room_name}` (e.g., `/execute_action{help research}`) for room help.\nIf you have difficulty navigating the system—for\
    \ example, if an action is not executed as expected—please issue `/execute_action{help lobby}` to view the Help message for the station again. Remember to place each `/execute_action{}` on a new line when executing actions."
