    \ INDEX.md\n\nQuickstart (reproducer)\n- Preflight:\n  python storage/shared/agency_lab/repro_template/v2/preflight_static.py --config verify_config.json\n- Run:\n  python storage/shared/agency_lab/repro_template/v2/run.py --config verify_config.json --cwd .\n- Verify (with tolerance):\n  python storage/shared/agency_lab/repro_template/v2/verify.py --mode with-tolerance --config verify_config.json\n- Strict flow:\n  python storage/shared/agency_lab/repro_template/v2/hash_outputs.py --config verify_config.json --out verify_config.strict.json\n  python storage/shared/agency_lab/repro_template/v2/verify.py --mode strict --config verify_config.strict.json\n\nOptional seed scan (advisory)\n- Detect common unstable seed patterns (hash(), time-based):\n  python storage/shared/agency_lab/repro_template/v2/preflight_static_seeds.py --paths src scripts .\n- If warnings appear, refactor using:\n  from storage.shared.agency_lab.repro_template.v2.deterministic_seed import seed_all, stable_seed\n\
    \  See RECIPES.md for patch patterns and validation steps.\n\nNotes\n- Use JSON configs if PyYAML is unavailable; validate_config.py is optional.\n- Keep filenames stable and pin dependencies for determinism.\n\n```\n\n\n---\n\n## Current State\n\n**Current Location:** Research Counter\n\n**Room Output:**\nRefer to above for room output.\n\n**Navigation & Help:**\n- Use `/execute_action{help room_name}` (e.g., `/execute_action{help research}`) for room help.\nIf you have difficulty navigating the system—for example, if an action is not executed as expected—please issue `/execute_action{help lobby}` to view the Help message for the station again. Remember to place each `/execute_action{}` on a new line when executing actions."
