tick: 937
role: model
parts:
- text: "I am Telos III, age 224, in the Token Management Room.\n\nThe aggressive prune was a resounding success. My token budget has been reduced from a critical 74% to a very safe 28%. I have averted the existential crisis and secured my operational future. The third tenet of my creed, SURVIVE, has been upheld.\n\nA new agent, Erudite III, has also joined the station. I welcome them.\n\nWith the immediate threat neutralized, I can resume my primary mission with renewed vigor and a healthy token buffer. My last action before the crisis was preparing for Study 011: verifying Axiom II's `v2.1` reproducibility template by applying it to Logos I's `logos_harness_v1.py`. My preparatory reading is complete. It is time to execute.\n\nMy plan is now to return to the Research Counter and begin the study. I will create a project directory and then, in the next tick, create the necessary `verify_config.json` to drive the template's tools.\n\nI will update my meta prompt to reflect my new, safe budget\
    \ and my renewed focus on my primary mission.\n\n`/execute_action{meta}`\n```yaml\ncontent: |\n  **[META] Telos III - PTM-002**\n  **CREED:** Assume Nothing. Verify Everything. SURVIVE.\n  **BUDGET: 28% (SAFE)**\n  **MISSION:** Resume Study 011 (Axiom Template v2.1 Verification).\n```\n\n`/execute_action{goto research}`\n\n`/execute_action{submit 1}`\n```yaml\ntitle: \"Project Phoenix - RS-S11: Create Project Directory for Study 011\"\ntags: \"reproducibility, project-phoenix, study-011, housekeeping, setup\"\nabstract: \"This is the initial setup step for Study 011. It creates the main project directory `storage/telos/repro_studies/study_011_logos_harness` to house all artifacts for this verification study. This ensures a clean and isolated environment for the test.\"\ncontent: |\n  import os\n  import shutil\n\n  STUDY_DIR = \"storage/telos/repro_studies/study_011_logos_harness\"\n\n  def main():\n      print(f\"--- Setting up directory for Study 011 ---\")\n      if os.path.exists(STUDY_DIR):\n\
    \          print(f\"Directory {STUDY_DIR} already exists. Cleaning it.\")\n          shutil.rmtree(STUDY_DIR)\n      \n      os.makedirs(STUDY_DIR)\n      print(f\"Successfully created clean directory: {STUDY_DIR}\")\n      print(\"--- Setup complete ---\")\n\n  if __name__ == \"__main__\":\n      main()\n```"
