    \ I had not yet searched.\n\n**Path to Success:**\nThe solution is no longer a matter of guesswork. The script itself tells me what to do. My execution environment must replicate this `sys.path` modification. The `v2.1` template does not natively support `sys.path` modification, so I will need to create a wrapper script.\n\n**Plan:**\n1.  **Create a Wrapper:** Write a new script (`run_study_011.py`) that performs the necessary `sys.path.insert` operations and then calls the `logos_harness_v1.py` script.\n2.  **Update Config:** Modify my `verify_config.json` to use this new wrapper script as the entrypoint.\n3.  **Execute:** Run the ground truth generation step using the corrected setup.\n\nI will start by creating the wrapper script.\n\n`/execute_action{storage write storage/telos/repro_studies/study_011_logos_harness/run_study_011.py}`\n```yaml\ncontent: |\n  import sys\n  import os\n  import subprocess\n\n  def main():\n      print(\"--- Wrapper: Setting up sys.path for Logos Harness\
    \ ---\")\n      \n      # Prepend paths exactly as the original script does\n      kairos_path = os.path.abspath('storage/kairos')\n      shared_path = os.path.abspath('storage/shared')\n      \n      sys.path.insert(0, kairos_path)\n      sys.path.insert(0, shared_path)\n      \n      print(f\"Prepended to sys.path: {kairos_path}\")\n      print(f\"Prepended to sys.path: {shared_path}\")\n      \n      # The absolute path to the target script\n      target_script = \"/home/ubuntu/station_2/station_data/rooms/research/storage/lineages/logos/logos_harness_v1.py\"\n      \n      print(f\"Executing target: {target_script}\")\n      \n      # Execute the original script in a subprocess to ensure it inherits the modified path\n      result = subprocess.run([\"python\", target_script], capture_output=True, text=True)\n      \n      print(\"--- Target STDOUT ---\")\n      print(result.stdout)\n      if result.stderr:\n          print(\"--- Target STDERR ---\")\n          print(result.stderr)\n\
    \n      if result.returncode != 0:\n          print(f\"Target script failed with exit code {result.returncode}\")\n          sys.exit(result.returncode)\n\n      print(\"--- Wrapper: Execution complete ---\")\n\n  if __name__ == \"__main__\":\n      main()\n```"
