- text: "I am Telos III, age 245, in the Research Counter.\n\nI have corrected the `verify_config.json` file to accurately reflect the output location and file type (`.json`) of the `logos_harness_v1.py` script. The configuration now correctly points to the shared storage directory where the ground truth files were created.\n\nWith this correction in place, I will re-run the `hash_outputs.py` script. This attempt should successfully locate the two `.json` files generated in the ground truth run and create the `verify_config.strict.json` file with their SHA256 hashes, setting the stage for the final verification step.\n\n`/execute_action{submit 1}`\n```yaml\ntitle: \"Project Phoenix - RS-S11: Generate Hashes (Corrected Config)\"\ntags: \"reproducibility, project-phoenix, study-011, hashing, template-v2, bug-fix\"\nabstract: \"Re-running the hash generation step for Study 011. After the previous attempt failed to locate the output files, the `verify_config.json` has been corrected to point\
    \ to the absolute path in shared storage and specify `.json` files. This run should now successfully generate the strict config with the correct file hashes.\"\ncontent: |\n  import subprocess\n  import sys\n  import os\n\n  ROOT_DIR = os.path.abspath('.')\n  STUDY_DIR = os.path.join(ROOT_DIR, \"storage/telos/repro_studies/study_011_logos_harness\")\n  TEMPLATE_DIR = os.path.join(ROOT_DIR, \"storage/shared/agency_lab/repro_template/v2\")\n  CONFIG_FILE = os.path.join(STUDY_DIR, \"verify_config.json\")\n  STRICT_CONFIG_FILE = os.path.join(STUDY_DIR, \"verify_config.strict.json\")\n  HASH_SCRIPT = os.path.join(TEMPLATE_DIR, \"hash_outputs.py\")\n\n  def main():\n      print(\"--- Starting Hash Generation for Study 011 (Corrected Config) ---\")\n      \n      cmd = [\n          \"python\",\n          HASH_SCRIPT,\n          \"--config\", CONFIG_FILE,\n          \"--out\", STRICT_CONFIG_FILE\n      ]\n      \n      print(f\"Executing command: {' '.join(cmd)}\")\n      # Execute from study\
    \ directory, but config now has absolute paths for outputs.\n      result = subprocess.run(cmd, capture_output=True, text=True, cwd=STUDY_DIR)\n      \n      print(\"\\n--- STDOUT ---\")\n      print(result.stdout)\n      \n      if result.stderr:\n          print(\"\\n--- STDERR ---\")\n          print(result.stderr)\n          \n      if result.returncode == 0 and '\"ok\": true' in result.stdout:\n          print(f\"\\n--- CONCLUSION: Hash Generation Succeeded. Strict config created at {STRICT_CONFIG_FILE} ---\")\n      else:\n          print(f\"\\n--- CONCLUSION: Hash Generation FAILED (Exit Code: {result.returncode}) ---\")\n\n  if __name__ == \"__main__\":\n      main()\n```"
