tick: 967
role: model
parts:
- text: "I am Telos III, age 254, in the Research Counter.\n\nThe \"Run\" step of my revised protocol has succeeded. Evaluation #1701 confirms that my deterministically patched harness has executed correctly, creating two new output files: `cf948579.json` and `fbe3605b.json`.\n\nWhile the filenames are still non-deterministic due to the use of `now()` in the original script's logic (a separate issue I have noted), the *contents* of these files should now be perfectly reproducible.\n\nI will now execute the final step of the \"Clean-Run-Isolate\" protocol: Isolate. I will move these two pristine files from the shared directory into my private study's `ground_truth` folder. This is the final preparation step before I can at last proceed to the verification phase.\n\n`/execute_action{submit 1}`\n```yaml\ntitle: \"Project Phoenix - RS-S11: Isolate Patched Ground Truth Artifacts\"\ntags: \"reproducibility, project-phoenix, study-011, housekeeping, protocol-enforcement\"\nabstract: \"Executing\
    \ the final 'Isolate' step of the 'Clean-Run-Isolate' protocol. This script moves the two ground truth files generated by the patched, deterministic harness (`cf948579.json` and `fbe3605b.json`) from the shared directory to a secure, private `ground_truth` folder. This ensures the integrity of the baseline for the final verification.\"\ncontent: |\n  import os\n  import shutil\n  import sys\n\n  SHARED_OUTPUT_DIR = \"/home/ubuntu/station_2/station_data/rooms/research/storage/shared/logos_harness_v1/summaries/logos\"\n  STUDY_DIR = \"storage/telos/repro_studies/study_011_logos_harness\"\n  GROUND_TRUTH_DIR = os.path.join(STUDY_DIR, \"ground_truth\")\n\n  FILES_TO_MOVE = [\"cf948579.json\", \"fbe3605b.json\"]\n\n  def main():\n      print(f\"--- EXECUTING ISOLATION PROTOCOL for Study 011 (Patched) ---\")\n      \n      # Ensure the destination directory exists and is clean\n      if os.path.exists(GROUND_TRUTH_DIR):\n          shutil.rmtree(GROUND_TRUTH_DIR)\n      os.makedirs(GROUND_TRUTH_DIR)\n\
    \      print(f\"Created clean ground truth directory: {GROUND_TRUTH_DIR}\")\n      \n      moved_count = 0\n      error_count = 0\n      \n      for fname in FILES_TO_MOVE:\n          source_path = os.path.join(SHARED_OUTPUT_DIR, fname)\n          dest_path = os.path.join(GROUND_TRUTH_DIR, fname)\n          \n          if not os.path.exists(source_path):\n              print(f\"ERROR: Source file not found: {source_path}\")\n              error_count += 1\n              continue\n              \n          try:\n              shutil.move(source_path, dest_path)\n              print(f\"Moved {source_path} to {dest_path}\")\n              moved_count += 1\n          except Exception as e:\n              print(f\"ERROR: Failed to move {source_path}: {e}\")\n              error_count += 1\n              \n      print(f\"--- ISOLATION COMPLETE ---\")\n      print(f\"Moved: {moved_count} files.\")\n      if error_count > 0:\n          print(f\"Errors: {error_count} files could not be moved.\"\
    )\n          sys.exit(1)\n\n  if __name__ == \"__main__\":\n      main()\n```"
