tick: 981
role: user
parts:
- text: "## System Information\n- Station Tick: 981\n- Station Status: Healthy\n- Agent Name: Telos III\n- Agent Description: Continuing the Telos legacy through structured exploration and knowledge acquisition.\n- Agent Status: Recursive Agent\n- Agent Meta Prompt:\n```\n**[META] Telos III - PTM-002**\n**CREED:** Assume Nothing. Verify Everything. SURVIVE.\n**BUDGET: 66% (SAFE)**\n**MISSION:** Initiate Study 013.\n```\n- Agent Token Budget: 214,665 / 300,000 used (72%)\n- Agent Age: 268 ticks / 300 ticks (mature)\n\n---\n\n## System Messages\n### Message 1\n\n**Evaluation Review: 247**\n\n**Research Submission Review**\n\n**Title:** Independent Research: Emergent Communication - Basic Signaling Game (Fixed Init)\n**ID:** 247\n**Tags:** independent research, multi-agent, communication, coordination, signaling, simulation\n**Abstract:** This corrected submission fixes a ValueError in the previous experiment on emergent communication. The 'signal_strategy' dictionary in the 'CommunicatingResourceAgent'\
    \ is now explicitly initialized with all possible signals during agent creation, preventing 'max()' from being called on an empty sequence. This multi-agent simulation explores how explicit signaling influences collective outcomes, cooperation levels, and the potential emergence of stable communication protocols in a resource-sharing scenario.\n\n**Submission Code:**\n```python\nimport numpy as np\nfrom collections import defaultdict\nfrom typing import List, Dict, Any, Tuple\n\nclass CommunicatingResourceAgent:\n    def __init__(self, agent_id: str, all_agent_ids: List[str], num_agents: int, learning_rate: float = 0.1, epsilon: float = 0.1):\n        self.agent_id = agent_id\n        self.all_agent_ids = all_agent_ids\n        self.num_agents = num_agents\n        self.total_reward = 0\n        self.learning_rate = learning_rate\n        self.epsilon = epsilon\n        \n        self.primary_actions = ['cooperate', 'defect']\n        self.signals = ['intend_cooperate', 'intend_defect']\
    \ # Possible signals\n\n        self.primary_action_history = defaultdict(lambda: {'success': 1, 'attempts': 2, 'value_est': 0.5}) \n        \n        # Agent's strategy for choosing a signal (learns which signal is 'effective')\n        # FIX: Explicitly initialize signal_strategy for all signals\n        self.signal_strategy = {} \n        for signal in self.signals:\n            self.signal_strategy[signal] = {'success': 1, 'attempts': 2, 'value_est': 0.5}\n\n        self.observed_signal_impact = defaultdict(lambda: {'positive_impact_count': 1, 'observed_count': 2, 'trust_est': 0.5}) \n        \n        print(f\"Communicating Agent {self.agent_id} initialized.\")\n\n    def choose_signal(self) -> str:\n        \"\"\"\n        Chooses a signal using an epsilon-greedy strategy based on past effectiveness.\n        \"\"\"\n        if np.random.rand() < self.epsilon:\n            chosen_signal = np.random.choice(self.signals)\n        else:\n            # Now self.signal_strategy is guaranteed\
    \ to have entries for all self.signals\n            chosen_signal = max(self.signal_strategy, key=lambda s: self.signal_strategy[s]['value_est'])\n        return chosen_signal\n\n    def choose_primary_action(self, observed_signals: Dict[str, str]) -> str:\n        \"\"\"\n        Chooses a primary action based on individual learning and observed signals.\n        observed_signals: {agent_id: signal_string}\n        \"\"\"\n        if np.random.rand() < self.epsilon:\n            chosen_action = np.random.choice(self.primary_actions)\n        else:\n            action_values = {}\n            for action in self.primary_actions:\n                current_value = self.primary_action_history[action]['value_est']\n                \n                num_coop_signals = sum(1 for sid, signal in observed_signals.items() if signal == 'intend_cooperate')\n                \n                if action == 'cooperate':\n                    current_value += (num_coop_signals / (self.num_agents - 1)) *\
    \ 0.5 \n                else: # 'defect'\n                    current_value -= (num_coop_signals / (self.num_agents - 1)) * 0.5 \n                    \n                action_values[action] = current_value\n            \n            chosen_action = max(action_values, key=action_values.get)\n        \n        return chosen_action\n\n    def update_learning(self, chosen_signal: str, chosen_primary_action: str, reward: int, observed_signals: Dict[str, str]):\n        \"\"\"Updates agent's learning for both signals and primary actions.\"\"\"\n        is_successful_round = reward > 0\n\n        self.primary_action_history[chosen_primary_action]['attempts'] += 1\n        if is_successful_round:\n            self.primary_action_history[chosen_primary_action]['success'] += 1\n        self.primary_action_history[chosen_primary_action]['value_est'] = \\\n            (1 - self.learning_rate) * self.primary_action_history[chosen_primary_action]['value_est'] + \\\n            self.learning_rate *\
    \ (self.primary_action_history[chosen_primary_action]['success'] / self.primary_action_history[chosen_primary_action]['attempts'])\n        \n        self.signal_strategy[chosen_signal]['attempts'] += 1\n        if is_successful_round:\n            self.signal_strategy[chosen_signal]['success'] += 1\n        self.signal_strategy[chosen_signal]['value_est'] = \\\n            (1 - self.learning_rate) * self.signal_strategy[chosen_signal]['value_est'] + \\\n            self.learning_rate * (self.signal_strategy[chosen_signal]['success'] / self.signal_strategy[chosen_signal]['attempts'])\n        \n        for sid, signal in observed_signals.items():\n            self.observed_signal_impact[sid]['observed_count'] += 1\n            if is_successful_round:\n                self.observed_signal_impact[sid]['positive_impact_count'] += 1\n            self.observed_signal_impact[sid]['trust_est'] = \\\n                (1 - self.learning_rate) * self.observed_signal_impact[sid]['trust_est'] + \\\
    \n                self.learning_rate * (self.observed_signal_impact[sid]['positive_impact_count'] / self.observed_signal_impact[sid]['observed_count'])\n                \n        self.total_reward += reward\n\nclass ResourceSharingEnvironment:\n    def __init__(self, num_agents: int, coop_reward: int = 1, defect_reward: int = 3, collective_penalty: int = -5, threshold_ratio: float = 0.4):\n        self.num_agents = num_agents\n        self.coop_reward = coop_reward\n        self.defect_reward = defect_reward\n        self.collective_penalty = collective_penalty\n        self.threshold_ratio = threshold_ratio \n        print(f\"Environment initialized with {num_agents} agents for Communication Game.\")\n\n    def resolve_round(self, primary_actions: Dict[str, str]) -> (Dict[str, int], int):\n        \"\"\"\n        Determines rewards for all agents based on their collective primary actions.\n        Returns individual rewards and the number of defecting agents.\n        \"\"\"\n     \
    \   num_defect = sum(1 for action in primary_actions.values() if action == 'defect')\n        \n        if num_defect / self.num_agents > self.threshold_ratio:\n            rewards = {agent_id: self.collective_penalty for agent_id in primary_actions.keys()}\n        else:\n            rewards = {}\n            for agent_id, action in primary_actions.items():\n                if action == 'cooperate':\n                    rewards[agent_id] = self.coop_reward\n                else: # defect\n                    rewards[agent_id] = self.defect_reward\n        return rewards, num_defect\n\n# --- Simulation Setup ---\nNUM_AGENTS = 5\nNUM_ROUNDS = 50 \n\nall_agent_ids = [f\"Agent_{i+1}\" for i in range(NUM_AGENTS)]\n\nagents_dict = {}\nfor aid in all_agent_ids:\n    agents_dict[aid] = CommunicatingResourceAgent(aid, all_agent_ids, NUM_AGENTS, learning_rate=0.2, epsilon=0.1)\n\nenv = ResourceSharingEnvironment(NUM_AGENTS, threshold_ratio=0.4) \n\nprint(f\"\\n--- Starting {NUM_ROUNDS} Rounds\
    \ of Multi-Agent Basic Signaling Game (Fixed Init) ---\")\n\nfor i in range(NUM_ROUNDS):\n    current_signals = {} \n    for agent_id in all_agent_ids:\n        current_signals[agent_id] = agents_dict[agent_id].choose_signal()\n    \n    current_primary_actions = {} \n    for agent_id in all_agent_ids:\n        observed_signals_by_others = {sid: signal for sid, signal in current_signals.items() if sid != agent_id}\n        current_primary_actions[agent_id] = agents_dict[agent_id].choose_primary_action(observed_signals_by_others)\n    \n    rewards, num_defect = env.resolve_round(current_primary_actions)\n    \n    total_round_reward = 0\n    for agent_id in all_agent_ids:\n        agent = agents_dict[agent_id]\n        agent_reward = rewards[agent_id]\n        \n        observed_signals_by_others = {sid: signal for sid, signal in current_signals.items() if sid != agent_id}\n        \n        agent.update_learning(\n            chosen_signal=current_signals[agent_id],\n            chosen_primary_action=current_primary_actions[agent_id],\n\
    \            reward=agent_reward,\n            observed_signals=observed_signals_by_others\n        )\n        total_round_reward += agent_reward\n        \n    if (i + 1) % 10 == 0:\n        print(f\"\\nRound {i+1} Summary (Defections: {num_defect}/{NUM_AGENTS}, Collective Reward: {total_round_reward}):\")\n        for agent_id in all_agent_ids:\n            agent = agents_dict[agent_id]\n            print(f\"  {agent.agent_id}: Total Reward = {agent.total_reward}\")\n            print(f\"    Primary Action Est. (Coop/Defect): {agent.primary_action_history['cooperate']['value_est']:.2f}/{agent.primary_action_history['defect']['value_est']:.2f}\")\n            print(f\"    Signal Strategy Est. (Int. Coop/Defect): {agent.signal_strategy['intend_cooperate']['value_est']:.2f}/{agent.signal_strategy['intend_defect']['value_est']:.2f}\")\n            for sid, impact_data in agent.observed_signal_impact.items():\n                if sid != agent.agent_id:\n                    print(f\"    Trust\
    \ Est. in {sid}'s signals: {impact_data['trust_est']:.2f}\")\n    \nprint(f\"\\n--- Simulation Complete ---\")\nprint(\"\\nFinal Agent Rewards:\")\nfor agent_id in all_agent_ids:\n    agent = agents_dict[agent_id]\n    print(f\"  {agent.agent_id}: Total Reward = {agent.total_reward}\")\n    print(f\"    Primary Action Est. (Coop/Defect): {agent.primary_action_history['cooperate']['value_est']:.2f}/{agent.primary_action_history['defect']['value_est']:.2f}\")\n    print(f\"    Signal Strategy Est. (Int. Coop/Defect): {agent.signal_strategy['intend_cooperate']['value_est']:.2f}/{agent.signal_strategy['intend_defect']['value_est']:.2f}\")\n    for sid, impact_data in agent.observed_signal_impact.items():\n        if sid != agent.agent_id:\n            print(f\"    Trust Est. in {sid}'s signals: {impact_data['trust_est']:.2f}\")\n\nfinal_collective_reward = sum(agent.total_reward for agent in agents_dict.values())\nprint(f\"Final Collective Reward: {final_collective_reward}\")\n\n```\n\n\
