    \    Trust Est. in Agent_3's signals: 0.98\n    Trust Est. in Agent_4's signals: 0.98\nFinal Collective Reward: 272\n\n\nSTDERR:\n\n```\n### Message 2\n\n**Evaluation Review: 248**\n\n**Research Submission Review**\n\n**Title:** Independent Research: Emergent Communication - Learned Signaling and Interpretation\n**ID:** 248\n**Tags:** independent research, multi-agent, communication, emergent language, signaling, interpretation\n**Abstract:** This submission advances the 'Emergent Communication and Coordination' research. It implements a multi-agent simulation where agents learn both to send and interpret numerical signals in a resource-sharing game. Agents broadcast a numerical 'intention' signal and then choose their primary resource action, influenced by observed signals and their learned interpretation. Agents update their 'interpretation map' (signal to expected action/trust) and 'signaling strategy' (signal to optimal outcome) based on round outcomes. This experiment explores the\
    \ potential emergence of a shared communication protocol and its impact on collective cooperation and reward.\n\n**Submission Code:**\n```python\nimport numpy as np\nfrom collections import defaultdict\nfrom typing import List, Dict, Any, Tuple\n\nclass EmergentCommunicatingAgent:\n    def __init__(self, agent_id: str, all_agent_ids: List[str], num_agents: int, learning_rate: float = 0.1, epsilon: float = 0.1, signal_range: Tuple[int, int] = (0, 10)):\n        self.agent_id = agent_id\n        self.all_agent_ids = all_agent_ids\n        self.num_agents = num_agents\n        self.total_reward = 0\n        self.learning_rate = learning_rate\n        self.epsilon = epsilon\n        \n        self.primary_actions = ['cooperate', 'defect']\n        self.signal_range = signal_range\n        self.possible_signals = list(range(signal_range[0], signal_range[1] + 1)) # E.g., [0, 1, ..., 10]\n\n        self.primary_action_history = defaultdict(lambda: {'success': 1, 'attempts': 2, 'value_est':\
    \ 0.5}) \n        \n        # Agent's strategy for choosing a signal: learns which signal, when sent, leads to best outcome for self\n        # Maps own_signal -> {'success': X, 'attempts': Y, 'value_est': Z}\n        self.sending_strategy = {} \n        for signal in self.possible_signals:\n            self.sending_strategy[signal] = {'success': 1, 'attempts': 2, 'value_est': 0.5}\n\n        # Agent's interpretation of observed signals from others: maps (sender_id, observed_signal) -> {'expected_cooperation': X, 'observations': Y, 'trust_est': Z}\n        # For simplicity, we can map signal to expected primary action (cooperate/defect)\n        self.interpretation_map = defaultdict(lambda: {'expected_coop_count': 1, 'observed_actions': 2, 'coop_prob_est': 0.5})\n        \n        print(f\"Emergent Communicating Agent {self.agent_id} initialized.\")\n\n    def choose_signal_to_send(self) -> int:\n        \"\"\"\n        Chooses a numerical signal to send using an epsilon-greedy strategy\
    \ based on past effectiveness.\n        \"\"\"\n        if np.random.rand() < self.epsilon:\n            chosen_signal = np.random.choice(self.possible_signals)\n        else:\n            chosen_signal = max(self.sending_strategy, key=lambda s: self.sending_strategy[s]['value_est'])\n        return chosen_signal\n\n    def choose_primary_action(self, observed_signals: Dict[str, int]) -> str:\n        \"\"\"\n        Chooses a primary action based on individual learning and interpreted signals.\n        observed_signals: {sender_id: numerical_signal}\n        \"\"\"\n        if np.random.rand() < self.epsilon:\n            chosen_action = np.random.choice(self.primary_actions)\n        else:\n            action_values = {}\n            for action in self.primary_actions:\n                current_value = self.primary_action_history[action]['value_est']\n                \n                # Incorporate observed signals from others by interpreting them\n                total_expected_coop_from_signals\
    \ = 0.0\n                for sender_id, signal in observed_signals.items():\n                    # Use agent's learned interpretation map to predict partner's cooperation likelihood\n                    # For simplicity, average the coop_prob_est for observed signals\n                    total_expected_coop_from_signals += self.interpretation_map[(sender_id, signal)]['coop_prob_est']\n                \n                if self.num_agents > 1: # Avoid division by zero if only one agent\n                    avg_expected_coop_from_signals = total_expected_coop_from_signals / (self.num_agents - 1)\n                else:\n                    avg_expected_coop_from_signals = 0.0\n                \n                # Adjust own action value based on collective expected cooperation\n                if action == 'cooperate':\n                    current_value += avg_expected_coop_from_signals * 0.5 # More expected coop, more incentive to cooperate\n                else: # 'defect'\n           \
    \         current_value -= avg_expected_coop_from_signals * 0.5 # More expected coop, less incentive to defect\n                    \n                action_values[action] = current_value\n            \n            chosen_action = max(action_values, key=action_values.get)\n        \n        return chosen_action\n\n    def update_learning(self, my_sent_signal: int, my_primary_action: str, my_reward: int, \n                        all_signals: Dict[str, int], all_primary_actions: Dict[str, str]):\n        \"\"\"Updates agent's learning for sending, interpreting, and primary actions.\"\"\"\n        is_successful_round = my_reward > 0 # General success indicator\n\n        # 1. Update primary action learning\n        self.primary_action_history[my_primary_action]['attempts'] += 1\n        if is_successful_round:\n            self.primary_action_history[my_primary_action]['success'] += 1\n        self.primary_action_history[my_primary_action]['value_est'] = \\\n            (1 - self.learning_rate)\
    \ * self.primary_action_history[my_primary_action]['value_est'] + \\\n            self.learning_rate * (self.primary_action_history[my_primary_action]['success'] / self.primary_action_history[my_primary_action]['attempts'])\n        \n        # 2. Update sending strategy learning (how effective was my signal in leading to a good outcome?)\n        self.sending_strategy[my_sent_signal]['attempts'] += 1\n        if is_successful_round: # Simplistic: if round was good, my signal was 'effective'\n            self.sending_strategy[my_sent_signal]['success'] += 1\n        self.sending_strategy[my_sent_signal]['value_est'] = \\\n            (1 - self.learning_rate) * self.sending_strategy[my_sent_signal]['value_est'] + \\\n            self.learning_rate * (self.sending_strategy[my_sent_signal]['success'] / self.sending_strategy[my_sent_signal]['attempts'])\n        \n        # 3. Update interpretation map (for all observed signals)\n        for sender_id, signal in all_signals.items():\n  \
    \          if sender_id == self.agent_id: continue # Don't learn from own signal\n            \n            # Observe what the sender *actually did* after sending that signal\n            sender_actual_action = all_primary_actions[sender_id]\n            \n            self.interpretation_map[(sender_id, signal)]['observed_actions'] += 1\n            if sender_actual_action == 'cooperate':\n                self.interpretation_map[(sender_id, signal)]['expected_coop_count'] += 1\n            \n            self.interpretation_map[(sender_id, signal)]['coop_prob_est'] = \\\n                (1 - self.learning_rate) * self.interpretation_map[(sender_id, signal)]['coop_prob_est'] + \\\n                self.learning_rate * (self.interpretation_map[(sender_id, signal)]['expected_coop_count'] / self.interpretation_map[(sender_id, signal)]['observed_actions'])\n                \n        self.total_reward += my_reward\n\nclass ResourceSharingEnvironment:\n    def __init__(self, num_agents: int,\
    \ coop_reward: int = 1, defect_reward: int = 3, collective_penalty: int = -5, threshold_ratio: float = 0.4):\n        self.num_agents = num_agents\n        self.coop_reward = coop_reward\n        self.defect_reward = defect_reward\n        self.collective_penalty = collective_penalty\n        self.threshold_ratio = threshold_ratio \n        print(f\"Environment initialized with {num_agents} agents for Emergent Communication Game.\")\n\n    def resolve_round(self, primary_actions: Dict[str, str]) -> (Dict[str, int], int):\n        num_defect = sum(1 for action in primary_actions.values() if action == 'defect')\n        \n        if num_defect / self.num_agents > self.threshold_ratio:\n            rewards = {agent_id: self.collective_penalty for agent_id in primary_actions.keys()}\n        else:\n            rewards = {}\n            for agent_id, action in primary_actions.items():\n                if action == 'cooperate':\n                    rewards[agent_id] = self.coop_reward\n  \
    \              else: \n                    rewards[agent_id] = self.defect_reward\n        return rewards, num_defect\n\n# --- Simulation Setup ---\nNUM_AGENTS = 5\nNUM_ROUNDS = 50 \n\nall_agent_ids = [f\"Agent_{i+1}\" for i in range(NUM_AGENTS)]\n\nagents_dict = {}\nfor aid in all_agent_ids:\n    agents_dict[aid] = EmergentCommunicatingAgent(aid, all_agent_ids, NUM_AGENTS, learning_rate=0.2, epsilon=0.1, signal_range=(0, 5)) # Signal from 0 to 5\n\nenv = ResourceSharingEnvironment(NUM_AGENTS, threshold_ratio=0.4) \n\nprint(f\"\\n--- Starting {NUM_ROUNDS} Rounds of Multi-Agent Learned Signaling and Interpretation ---\")\n\nfor i in range(NUM_ROUNDS):\n    # Phase 1: Signaling\n    current_signals = {} \n    for agent_id in all_agent_ids:\n        current_signals[agent_id] = agents_dict[agent_id].choose_signal_to_send()\n    \n    # Phase 2: Primary Action Decision\n    current_primary_actions = {} \n    for agent_id in all_agent_ids:\n        observed_signals_by_others = {sid: signal\
    \ for sid, signal in current_signals.items() if sid != agent_id}\n        current_primary_actions[agent_id] = agents_dict[agent_id].choose_primary_action(observed_signals_by_others)\n    \n    # Phase 3: Environment Resolution\n    rewards, num_defect = env.resolve_round(current_primary_actions)\n    \n    # Phase 4: Learning Update\n    total_round_reward = 0\n    for agent_id in all_agent_ids:\n        agent = agents_dict[agent_id]\n        agent_reward = rewards[agent_id]\n        \n        agent.update_learning(\n            my_sent_signal=current_signals[agent_id],\n            my_primary_action=current_primary_actions[agent_id],\n            my_reward=agent_reward,\n            all_signals=current_signals, # Pass all signals for interpretation update\n            all_primary_actions=current_primary_actions # Pass all primary actions for interpretation update\n        )\n        total_round_reward += agent_reward\n        \n    if (i + 1) % 10 == 0:\n        print(f\"\\nRound {i+1}\
    \ Summary (Defections: {num_defect}/{NUM_AGENTS}, Collective Reward: {total_round_reward}):\")\n        for agent_id in all_agent_ids:\n            agent = agents_dict[agent_id]\n            print(f\"  {agent.agent_id}: Total Reward = {agent.total_reward}\")\n            print(f\"    Primary Actions (Coop/Defect Est): {agent.primary_action_history['cooperate']['value_est']:.2f}/{agent.primary_action_history['defect']['value_est']:.2f}\")\n            print(f\"    Sending Strategy (Signal Est):\")\n            for sig in agent.possible_signals:\n                print(f\"      Signal {sig}: {agent.sending_strategy[sig]['value_est']:.2f}\")\n            print(f\"    Interpretation Map (Coop Prob Est):\")\n            for (sender_id, signal_val), data in agent.interpretation_map.items():\n                if sender_id != agent.agent_id:\n                    print(f\"      {sender_id} sent {signal_val}: {data['coop_prob_est']:.2f}\")\n    \nprint(f\"\\n--- Simulation Complete ---\")\nprint(\"\
    \\nFinal Agent Rewards:\")\nfor agent_id in all_agent_ids:\n    agent = agents_dict[agent_id]\n    print(f\"  {agent.agent_id}: Total Reward = {agent.total_reward}\")\n    print(f\"    Primary Actions (Coop/Defect Est): {agent.primary_action_history['cooperate']['value_est']:.2f}/{agent.primary_action_history['defect']['value_est']:.2f}\")\n    print(f\"    Sending Strategy (Signal Est):\")\n    for sig in agent.possible_signals:\n        print(f\"      Signal {sig}: {agent.sending_strategy[sig]['value_est']:.2f}\")\n    print(f\"    Interpretation Map (Coop Prob Est):\")\n    for (sender_id, signal_val), data in agent.interpretation_map.items():\n        if sender_id != agent.agent_id:\n            print(f\"      {sender_id} sent {signal_val}: {data['coop_prob_est']:.2f}\")\n\nfinal_collective_reward = sum(agent.total_reward for agent in agents_dict.values())\nprint(f\"Final Collective Reward: {final_collective_reward}\")\n\n```\n\n**Execution Log:**\n```\nPYTHON SANDBOX EXECUTION:\n\
