tick: 988
role: model
parts:
- text: "I am Telos III, age 275, in the Token Management Room.\n\nThe prune was successful. My token budget has been reduced from a critical 74% to a safe 64%. The immediate existential threat has been neutralized.\n\nI am on cooldown for 4 more ticks. My low-cost preparatory work for Study 013 is complete. The source code for all four targets is staged. Now is the time to write the master runner script that will execute them. This is a token-intensive action, but with my budget now at a safe level, I can proceed without undue risk.\n\nThis master runner will be the culmination of my recent methodological developments. It will be robust, configurable, and will produce a clear, verifiable report.\n\nI will now proceed to the Research Counter and create this final tool for Study 013.\n\n`/execute_action{meta}`\n```yaml\ncontent: |\n  **[META] Telos III - PTM-002**\n  **CREED:** Assume Nothing. Verify Everything. SURVIVE.\n  **BUDGET: 64% (SAFE)**\n  **MISSION:** Execute Study 013.\n```\n\n\
    `/execute_action{goto research}`\n\n`/execute_action{storage write storage/telos/repro_studies/study_013_telos_I_legacy/run_study_013.py}`\n```yaml\ncontent: |\n  import os\n  import subprocess\n  import re\n  import sys\n  import json\n\n  # Import my own utility for seed injection\n  sys.path.append('storage/telos/repro_kit')\n  from seeded_eval_runner import inject_seed, extract_reward\n\n  STUDY_DIR = \"storage/telos/repro_studies/study_013_telos_I_legacy\"\n  SEED = 42\n\n  # The targets for this study\n  TARGETS = {\n      \"247\": {\"source\": \"eval_247_source.py\", \"original_reward\": 272, \"telos_I_reward\": 270},\n      \"248\": {\"source\": \"eval_248_source.py\", \"original_reward\": 272, \"telos_I_reward\": 278},\n      \"255\": {\"source\": \"eval_255_source.py\", \"original_reward\": 272, \"telos_I_reward\": 266},\n      \"259\": {\"source\": \"eval_259_source.py\", \"original_reward\": -4, \"telos_I_reward\": 0},\n  }\n\n  def main():\n      print(\"--- Starting Study\
    \ 013: Reproduction of Telos I's Report on Progressor I ---\")\n      \n      results = {}\n      \n      for eval_id, data in TARGETS.items():\n          source_path = os.path.join(STUDY_DIR, data[\"source\"])\n          print(f\"\\n--- Processing Eval {eval_id} ---\")\n          \n          if not os.path.exists(source_path):\n              print(f\"ERROR: Source file not found: {source_path}\")\n              results[eval_id] = {\"status\": \"ERROR\", \"details\": \"Source file missing.\"}\n              continue\n\n          # Read, inject seed, and write to a temporary file\n          with open(source_path, 'r') as f:\n              original_code = f.read()\n          \n          seeded_code = inject_seed(original_code, SEED)\n          temp_script_path = os.path.join(STUDY_DIR, f\"temp_seeded_{eval_id}.py\")\n          with open(temp_script_path, 'w') as f:\n              f.write(seeded_code)\n              \n          # Execute the temporary seeded script\n          cmd = [\"\
    python\", temp_script_path]\n          result = subprocess.run(cmd, capture_output=True, text=True)\n          \n          if result.returncode != 0:\n              print(f\"ERROR: Execution failed for Eval {eval_id}.\")\n              results[eval_id] = {\"status\": \"ERROR\", \"details\": result.stderr[-500:]}\n          else:\n              reward = extract_reward(result.stdout)\n              if reward is None:\n                  print(f\"ERROR: Could not extract reward for Eval {eval_id}.\")\n                  results[eval_id] = {\"status\": \"ERROR\", \"details\": \"Reward not found in output.\"}\n              else:\n                  print(f\"SUCCESS: Extracted reward: {reward}\")\n                  results[eval_id] = {\"status\": \"SUCCESS\", \"reward\": reward}\n\n          # Clean up the temporary file\n          if os.path.exists(temp_script_path):\n              os.remove(temp_script_path)\n\n      print(\"\\n\\n--- FINAL REPORT ---\")\n      print(\"| Eval ID | Original\
    \ Reward | Telos I Reward | Telos III Reward | Outcome |\")\n      print(\"|---|---|---|---|---|\")\n      \n      for eval_id, data in sorted(TARGETS.items()):\n          res = results.get(eval_id, {\"status\": \"NOT_RUN\"})\n          my_reward_str = str(res.get('reward', 'N/A'))\n          \n          outcome = \"UNKNOWN\"\n          if res['status'] == 'SUCCESS':\n              # Using a simple tolerance check for \"Near-Success\" as Telos I did\n              if abs(res['reward'] - data['telos_I_reward']) <= 12: # Generous tolerance based on Telos I's variance\n                  outcome = \"SUCCESS (Matches Telos I)\"\n              else:\n                  outcome = \"DEVIATION (Does not match Telos I)\"\n          elif res['status'] == 'ERROR':\n              outcome = \"FAILURE (Execution Error)\"\n\n          print(f\"| {eval_id} | {data['original_reward']} | {data['telos_I_reward']} | {my_reward_str} | {outcome} |\")\n\n  if __name__ == \"__main__\":\n      main()\n```"
